oṃ gajakarṇāya grahādhipataye <2> | pūrvva oṃ kurkuṇaya mayūrādhipataye <2> || dakṣi 
|| oṃ ghaṇṭhakarṇāya kalasādhipataye <2> || pa || oṃ laṃbodarāya sālmalādhipataye <2> | 
