va ṛṣavṛdhamasi || sūrpe taṃḍūlaṃdhā || oṃ parāputa guṁ ra || tuṣaśirasayet || oṃ 
devo vaḥ sa || sthāligarbha taṃḍūlaṃdhā || oṃ apā guṁ rasa || amṛtapradānaṃ || 
sthālī pātracchuye || oṃ iṣatvorjjatvā ||

<p. 10b> aṃsakāya || abhighārayati kṣājyapātra oṃ agniṃ gaccha sva yajamānāya 
bindu svāhā oṃ viṣṇuṃ gaccha svayajamānāya biṃdu svāhā || agniyā nāma || 
maṃgalāgnaye svāhā || ghṛtāhuti kṛtvā || ghṛtāhuti pūrṇā tilāhuti kṛtvā || 
brahmā ādinathiyake deśāpāṭana tilāhuti sarvve datvā || kalasa pratiṣṭhā || 
saṃkṣāhuti ||
vadhulāsālahe svastikāsana pūrvvamukhaṃ || oṃ rakṣohanamiti || mimyāla || oṃ 
adhyavocati || bali || aṣṭakalasavisarjanayāye || aṣṭakalasana snānayācake || oṃ juṃ 
jatetyādina cyākaṇḍi <8> || aṃtra laṃghana snānayācaketvaṃ || aṃtra 
vastranatiyaketvaṃ ||
lāsāle jajñasiṃhāsanayā utaradi

<p. 11a> saste || arghapātra laṃṣanahāyake || svānataṃnake vadhu puruṣa saha || 
agnidipaloharakṣā || puruṣena tritatvana lomavilomana sodhanaṃ kṛtvā ||

aṣṭamaṃgalavastraviye cusivarāna saṃṣaye sovoṭhe || oṃ dīrghāyustvā || 
kaṃkayina saṃyāye || saṃpyāye || svasti vākyana || kumāri sūtreṇa veṣṭayet || <3> 
|| oṃ rakṣopātasūtreṇa veṣṭayet || <3> || oṃ pavitresthe || pāśacchāye || oṃ vasopavitra || 
śiṃdharacchāye oṃ śrīścate lakṣmī || aṃjana || oṃ tacca kṣurdeva || 
udumbarayugma <2> oṃ śivo nāmāsi || kuśapuspatrīni <3> || oṃ brahmaṇaspate || 
luṃkhopā oho khopā muḍu || oṃ hiraṇyagarbha || oṃ ayamūrjāvato vṛkṣa 
ūrjāvaphalānī bhavata || vadhu śrutvā || caṃdanādi sagvana āśīrvvāda || oṃ 
śrīvacchaśvamā || āhutiviye || oṃ sapta ṛṣa || āhuti || oṃ manojāti || pratiṣṭhā || 
anukramena caruprāsana ||

<p. 11b> brāhmaṇana svastivācanaṃ pathet ||

punaryajñasiṃhāsane uttarabhāgasate āhuti || oṃ ākṛṣṇe || yahamālātvāya || 
grahamālāviye || oṃ tvaṃ javiṣṭa kumālakalasavirjanayāya jajñamaṇḍapahe || 
kumārakalasayātaṃ āhuti || oṃ jatrapānāsaṃpataṃ || kumāra 
brāhmaṇacālaṃsoya | thaṃkādina || nṛvacchanādi paripāthina || lāsālahe || 
svānataṃṅāva kāye javamuṇḍesa soṅate strī na ||

vadhuśṛṇuyāt || vaṃśasabda || āhuti || oṃ athāhavīnāgadinorājāna guṁ 
sagāyatāṃ || yomāpyanyo vīrakara īti niyuktāmayake gāthāmupodāharaṃti || 
venaśabda || āhuti || oṃ ayaṃ venaśyo dasatpṛśni garbhājyotirjjarāyū rajaso 
vimāne | i mama pā guṁ saṃgame suryyasya śiśunyaviprāmatibhīrhati || gīta || 
āhuti || oṃ vvedosijenatvaṃ |

<p. 12a> devavvedadevvebhyovvedo bhavastena mahyaṃ vedobhūyā || 
paṃcaśabdamṛdaṃgādi || āhuti || oṃ nama saṃbhavāya || vīrakathā hlāya || āhuti 
|| oṃ saṃtvamagne sūryasya varccasāgathāḥ samṛṣīṇā guṁ stutena | saṃpriyeṇa 
dhāmnāsamahamāyuṣā saṃvarccasā saṃprajāyāsa guṁ rāyaspoṣeṇagmiṣīya || 
nārāyaṇastaṃ yajamānastaṃ mehālake || āhuti || pratiṣṭhā ||

kumālakalasadānayāya || kumāra brāhmanacāpūjāyāya || āsanādi 
hastārghatvaṃ vastrādi alaṃkāraviye | raktacaṃdanādī dīpātaṃ || puruṣa na 
dānaviya || adya bālāhakalpetyādi adyādi || vākya || 

amukagotrāya amukanāmne kumārabrāhmaṇāya pūrṇākṣata suvarṇagarbhita 
sacchatravastrasaṃyute kumārakalasaṃ putrakāmanayā tubhyamahaṃ saṃpradade 
|| dānavākyaṃ || 
brāhmanena kodāt paṭhet || anna saṃkalpa || dakṣiṇā śuvarṇa || puruṣa strī 
āśīrvvāda || brāhmanena || stuti pathet puruṣe || kumāra brāhmaṇa cātha 
vacchecchoye || 

<p. 12b> puruṣa strī agre tiṣṭhati || keśavārccana pūjā || sveta vidhina || ācanaṃ 
kṛtvā sūryārghayāya || nyāsayāya || arghapātrapūjā || ātmapūjā || oṃ 
tatvājāmi || oṃ devasya tvā || oṃ gaṇānāṃtvā || oṃ bṛhaspate || oṃ 
catvāriśṛṃgā oṃ dvāro devi || oṃ idaṃ viṣṇu || oṃ śrīścate lakṣmī ||

oṃ ādhāraśaktaye <2> || anantāsnā <2> || padmāsnāya <2> || keśarāya <2> || karṇikāya <2> || 
garuḍāsnāya <2> || viṣṇave <2> || 

dhyāna || 
oṃ caturbbāhu dharaṃ nityaṃ lakṣmī vāmāṃga saṃsthitāṃ |
sadā daityāntakaṃ devaṃ dhyāye taṃ sarvvasiddhidaṃ || 

keśavāya <2> || nārāyaṇāya <2> || śrīdevyai <2> || lakṣmīdevyai <2> maṃgalāyai <2> || 
maṃgalāyai nama || oṃ juṃjatetyādi || <8> || oṃ suparṇosigaru oṃ asijamo || oṃ 
suvarṇapāṃca || oṃ pavitresthe || oṃ śivo nāmasi || oṃ asmākamiṃdra || oṃ samita guṁ ||

<p. 13a> oṃ śrīścate lakṣmī || catusvasti || oṃ dhūrasi || oṃ tejosi || oṃ jāphalanī || oṃ 
annapate || oṃ manojoti || jāpa || stuti || 
oṃ lakṣmīpate namastubhyaṃ sarvvasaṃpatidāyakaṃ |
kāmadaṃ mokṣadaṃścaiva dhanadā putradāyakaṃ ||

jasyahastaṃ || pāpohaṃtyādi || thavataṃ caṃdanādi || svetavidhipūjā ||
jajñasiṃhāsana uttarabhāge tiṣṭhati || śīmantani || āhuti || oṃ 
māhirbhūrmāpṛdā kurnnamasta ātānānarvā prehi | ghṛtasya kulyā uparitasya 
pathyā anu svāhā || āhuti || oṃ manojoti pratiṣṭhā || vadhū śrutvā || amukadevī 
putravatī bhavatu || oṃ soma eva norājena mānuṣī prajā abhimukti cakrāḥ 
āśīraṃstīre tubhyamayoḥ vāgmatyāṃ 

<p. 13b> ca saṃnihita āyurbhavatu || ete vadhu śrutvā 
brāhmaṇapūjā || śāntika puṣṭika || javadhānādi kuśaṇḍi paripāṭathe dhunake  
|| śumaṃḍhe aṣṭamaṃgalamaṃḍhe agnisaḍoya || agnivisarjana || balicchoye || 
jajamānādi abhiseṣa āśīrvvādatvaṃ || sephaṃ ārathi || komāri darśana || 
sūryasākṣithāya || keśavārccana thāparape brāhmanena || śumaṃḍhiviya || iti 
sīmaṃtonayanakarmma samāptaṃ ||

atha māsāpuraṇakarmma || śubhadivase || vadhu snātvā || puspabhājanaṃ || 
kalasārccana || sagona || gaṇa gogrāsa kaumārī bali kevo ete brāhmaṇe pūjayet || oṃ 
tatvājāmityādi || dvārapūjā || kalasapūjā || sagonapūjā || oṃ ākṛṣṇetyādi || oṃ 
trātāramiṃdratyādi || oṃ aśvastheyotyādi || māsanakṣatra || balipūjā || 
duṃkhāpiṃkhā kevopūjā ||

<p. 14a> gaṇapati gogrāsa kaumārīpūjā || ākāśamāla || hnasakana || 
siṃdharamuṃṅa || catusvasti || dhūpa || dīpa || phala || naivedya || pratiṣṭhā || jāpa || 
stotra || brāhmanapūjā || śāntika paṭhet || metaṃphaṃtādacāpūjā || 
vadhūlāsālāvahe || svastikasavaṃsācakaṃte || nṛvaṃcchana || 
arghapātralaṃṣanahāya || oṃ soṣyantī madbhirabhyukṣatiḥ yathāvātaḥ puṣkariṇī 
guṁ samīṅgapratisarvvataḥ | evāte garbha ejaḍḍaśahāvaiḍḍajarāyuṇā | 
indrasyāyaṃ vrajaḥ kṛtaḥ sārggaḍaḥ sapariśrayaḥ tamindranirjjahi 
garbhaṇasāvara (*)(?) saheti || svānataṃnake || śāntika svānaviye || 
metaṃphaṃ ṭāḍacā sagonanaṭvāya || caṃdanādisagvana āśīrvvāda || 
jābhoh"navanaṃ tasya pūjāyāye || vaṭa ādina lāṅākyaṃ cayatādayakaṃ ||

<p. 14b> oṃ tatvājāmi || oṃ devasyatvā || oṃ tvamagnedubhi || oṃ prajāpatena || oṃ annapate 
|| oṃ manojo || brāhmaṇa annasaṃkalpa || puruṣanajābhonaṭvāṅāva 
vadhulādājānake || sagvanadharine pāṭanavāre || ucchiṣṭakaraṃkacchoye || 
laṃṣanahāye || āśīrvvāda || oṃ annapate || oṃ manojoti || pratiṣṭhā || dakṣiṇā || 
vācanakalasasate || kalaśa āśīrvvāda || nyāsa balivisarjana || abhiṣekādisagvana 
āśīrvvāda sarvva || puruṣena sephaṃ ārathā || kumārī darśana || 
thaṃkādisyaṃ sākṣithāya || saṃtikohnu puruṣa strī sahasnānayāye || 
nityakesavārccanayāya || iti māsāpūrṇavidhiḥ samāptaḥ ||

atha jātakarmma || jātakṣuraṅāvanārāyaṇatvaṃ kāpolane pusyaṃte || tatrādau 
pitāthaṃkādi snānaṃ kṛtvā || nāṃdimukhajavodakayāya || thaṃkādisyaṃ || 
brāhmaṇena kalasārccana ||

<p. 15a> bhucāsa kakuḍa <2> toyukāpaḍagoya kāṃlovaṃpe thvate sagvanadevane 
tasyaṃte || ekāpaklāsahetana || oṃ tatvājāmityādi || grahasya sa(?)pūjā || pratiṣṭhā 
|| jāpa || stotra || brāhmaṇapūjā || śāntika || pauṣṭika āśīrvvāda || brāhmaṇa 
annasaṃkalpa || dakṣiṇā || baliharaṇaṃ pitādhautāmbare dhārayet || svastikāsane 
upaviśya pūrvvamukhaṃ || nṛvaṃcchana || kalesābhiseṣa || jalimyālāsate ādi || 
pitā abhiseṣa || caṃdanādi sagvana || āśīrvvāda || ārathi || jātasthāne || pitā 
brāhmaṇa gacchet || jalimyālā satayālaṃghanahāye pitāhastena || maṃtra || oṃ 
ejatudasamāsyo garbhājarāyunā saha | yathāyaṃ vāpurejati | yathā samudra ejati | 
evāyaṃ daśamāsyo asrajjarāyunā saha || oṃ yasyaite yajñiyo garbhā yasyai 
jonirhiraṇyayī | aṃgānya hrūtāyasya tanmātrā

<p. 15b> samajīgama guṁ svāhā || puna abhyukṣaṇamaṃtra || oṃ mama vaitu pṛśni 
śeṣala guṁ śune jārāyattave | naiva mā guṁ sena dhīvarīna kasmiśca nāyata nama 
vajrarāyupadyatāṃ || kumāra snānaṃ kuryāt || acchiṃnāyāṃ nāḍyāṃ || 
ghṛtamadhusuvarṇāntarhitayā lavaṃga piḍurhastena anāmikāṃguṣṭhena prāśa 
(*)(?) dadyāt || maṃtra || oṃ bhūstvayi dadhāmi || oṃ bhuvastvayi dadhāmi || oṃ svastvayi 
dadhāmi || oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svaḥ sarvvaṃ tvayi dadhāmi || kumāra ācamya || 
caṃdanādi āśirvvāda || kumārasya dakṣiṇakarṇe ālabhya maṃtra || oṃ 
agnirāyuṣmān savanaspatībhirāyuṣmāṃstena tvā yuṣāyuṣmaṃ taṃ karomi 
|| oṃ soma āyusmānsa oṣadhībhirāyuṣmāṃstena tvāyuṣāyuṣmaṃ taṃ karomi 
|| oṃ brahma āyuṣmaṃ tadbrāhmaṇairāyuṣmantattena

<p. 16a> tvāyuṣāyuṣmaṃ taṃ karomi || 
oṃ devā āyuṣmaṃ tastva mṛtairāyuṣmaṃ tastena tvāyuṣāyuṣmaṃ taṃ karomi ||
oṃ ṛṣaya āyuṣmaṃtaste vratairāyuṣmaṃ tastena tvāyuṣāyuṣmaṃ taṃ karomi ||
oṃ pitara āyuṣmaṃtaste svadhābhirāyuṣmaṃ tastena tvāyuṣā yuṣmaṃ taṃ 
karomi || oṃ yajña āyuṣmān sadakṣiṇābhirāyuṣmāṃ tastena tvāyuṣāyuṣmaṃ 
taṃ karomi || oṃ samudra āyuṣmān saṃsravaṃ nābhirāyuṣmaṃ tastena 
tvāyuṣāyuṣmaṃ taṃ karomi || punakarṇe abhipṛsatimaṃtraḥ || oṃ tryāyuṣaṃ 
jamagneḥ kaśyapasya tryāyuṣaṃ | yaddeveṣu tryāyuṣaṃ taṃno astu tryāṣaṃ || 
tatkarṇe abhipṛśati maṃtra || oṃ sayadikāmayet sarvvamāyurīyānā || oṃ 
iḍāsimaitrāvvaruṇo vīre vīramatījamathā || sātvaṃ vīravatī bhava yasmāt 
varivato karate || punaḥ piturhastena kumārasya vākpṛsati

<p. 16b> maṃtra || oṃ divaspari prathamaṃ yajñe agnirasma dvitīyaṃ parijātavedāḥ | 
tṛtīyamapsunṛmanā ajasramindhāna enaṃ jarate svādhīḥ || <1> ||
oṃ vidmāte ange tredhā trayāṇi vidmāte dhāma vibhṛtā purutrā |
vidmāte nāmaparamaṃ guhā yadvidmātamutsaṃyata ājagaṃtha || <2> ||
oṃ samudre tvā nṛmaṇā apsvaṃtarnṛcakṣā īdhe divo agra ūdhan |
tṛtīye tvā rajasitasthi vā guṁ samayāmupasthe mahiṣā avarddhan || <3> ||
oṃ akraṃdadagnistanayannivadyauḥ kṣāmāreriha dvīrudhaḥ samaṃjan |
sadyojajñāno vihīmiddho akhyadārodasībhān nābhābhyaṃtaḥ || <4> ||
śrīṇāmudāro dharuṇorayīṇāṃ manīṣāṇāṃ prārpaṇaḥ somagopāḥvvasuḥ 
sūnuḥ sahaso apsurājāvvibhātyagra uṣasāmidhānaḥ || <5> || 
oṃ viśvasya keturbhuvanasya garbha ārodasī apṛṇājjāyamānaḥ |
viḍūṃcidadrimabhinatyarāyaṃ

<p. 17a> janāyadagnimaya jaṃtapaṃca || <6> ||
oṃ uśikyāvako aratiḥ sumedhāmartteṣvagniramṛto nidhāyi |
iyartti dhūmamaruṣaṃ bharibhraducchukreṇa śocidhādyāminakṣan || <7> ||
oṃ dṛśānorukma ūrvyāvyadyau durmmarṣamāyuḥ śriyerucānaḥ |
agniramṛto abhavaddhayobhiryadenaṃ dyaurajana yatsuretāḥ || <8> ||
yaste adyakṛṇavadbhadraśoce pūpaṃ deva ghṛtavaṃtamagne |
prataṃ naya prataraṃ vasyo acchābhisumnaṃ devabhaktayaviṣṭa || <9> ||
oṃ ātaṃbhajasau śravaseṣvagna uktha uktha ābhajasasya māne |
priyaḥ sūrye priyo agnābhavābhyurjjā tenabhinadadujjanitvai || <10> ||
oṃ tvāmagne yajamānā anudyūnviśvā vasudadhirevāryyāṇi |
tvayā saha dravinamicchamānāvrajaṃ gomaṃta muśijo vivuvruḥ || <11> ||
oṃ iti ekādaśa ṛcena japet | pitāpaṭhe mantra |

<p. 17b> oṃ imamanuprāṇiteti || punaryajamānana pūrvvābhimukha vrūyāt maṃtra 
|| oṃ prāṇāḥ || dakṣiṇābhimukhaṃ vruyāt mantra || oṃ apānāḥ || paści oṃ 
vyānāḥ || uttarābhimukhaṃ vrūyāt mantra || oṃ udānaḥ || madhya 
ūrddhamukhaṃ vrūyāt mantra || oṃ samānāḥ || pitākumāra jāta sthāne 
ālaṃbhana maṃtraḥ || oṃ vedate bhūmi hṛdayaṃ divi caṃdramasiśritaṃ |
vedāhaṃ tanmāntavidyān paśyamasaradaḥ śataṃjive meśaradaśataṃ guṁ 
śṛṇuyāma śaradaḥ śatamiti || punaḥ pitirhastena pṛśya kumāramālaṃbhana 
maṃtra || oṃ asmādbhava paraśurbhavahiraṇyamaśrutaṃ bhavaḥ | ātmā 
vaputranāmāsisaṃjīvasaradaḥ śataṃ || kumārasya mātaraṃmabhimantra || oṃ 
iḍāsimaitā varuṇī vīre vīramajījanathāḥ || sātvaṃ vīravatī bhavayāsmān 
vīravato bhavat || yajamānena mātarasya dakṣīnastana prakṣāṃla kumārasya 
prayacchati mantra || oṃ ima guṁ stanamurjjaṃ svataṃdhayāyāṃ prapīnamagne 
śarīrasyamadhye || utsaṃjuṣasvamadhumaṃtamarvvaṃ samudriya guṁ 
sadanamāviśasva || puna vāmahastena prakṣālya maṃtra || oṃ yaste stanaḥ

<p. 18a> śaśayoyomayo bhūyo ratnadhā vasuvidyaḥ sudatraḥ |
yena viśvāyusya śivāryāṇi sarasvatitamiha dhāvavekaḥ ||
kumārasya sayanasthāṇe śirapradeśe kalaśasthāpana maṃtra ||
oṃ āpodeveṣu jāgratha yathādeveṣu jāgrathā evamasyā guṁ sutikāyā guṁ 
suputrikāyāṃ jāgratha || tato nābhicchedanaṃ || brāhmaṇena svastivācanaṃ 
paṭhet || pitāsnānaṃ kuryāt || pitā abhiseṣayādi āśīrvvāda || <8> || iti jātakarmma 
samāptaḥ ||

tato dvāradeśe sūtikāgniṃ kṛtvā ||
sthāpanaṃ pūrvvamukhena || sūryārghaṃ || ākṛṣṇe gāyatri nyāsa || arghapātra 
|| ātmapūjā || oṃ jadevādeva || oṃ mānastoke || oṃ tatvājami || gāyatrodharanaṃ || oṃ 
sadasasyāti || oṃ bhīhayaśca me || oṃ devasya tvā || oṃ hiraṇyagarbha || oṃ padmānire 
|| oṃ tejosi || oṃ rakṣohanaṃ || oṃ hiraṇyavarṇā || oṃ tvāmṛtte || oṃ indhānāstvā 
|| oṃ ṛtavasthe || oṃ agnimurddhā oṃ kravyādamagniṃ || oṃ anvagniruṣa || jathā

<p. 18b> niti uccārya || oṃ mai gṛhānānyagre || svastivācana || oṃ marmmānite || oṃ 
pṛṣṭho divi || vedāsanaṃ || oṃ agnimīḍhetyādi || vedādipūjanaṃ || 
lokapālapūjanaṃ || sūtikāgnaye nama || oṃ eṣohadevaḥ prati || oṃ mahīdharāya 
namaḥ || bali gṛhna <2> svāhā || āvāhanādi || oṃ kāmadevāya nama || oṃ 
kāmadevāyamūrttaye nama || oṃ kāmadevāya nama || bali || āvāhanādi || oṃ 
pragalbhāgnyāsanaṃ nama || oṃ pragalbhāgnimūrttaye nama || oṃ pragalbhāgnaye 
nama || bali || āvāhanādi || samidha dāḍiṃvakāṣṭadvaye eka oṃ kālena juhuyāt || 
ekaṃ kṛṣṇī || ghṛtāhuti || oṃ śaṇḍāmarkkā upavīraḥ śauṇḍikeya unmūṣalaḥ | 
malimlū codroṇāsaścyavamānaśyatāditiḥ svāhā || puna āhuti maṃtra || oṃ 
ālikhannanimiṣaḥ kiṃ vadaṃta upaśrutiḥ | haryakṣa 
kuṃbhīśatrupātrayāmṛnihedīmukhaḥ śaṣapāruṇaścyavano naśyatāditiḥ 
svāhā || puna samidhahoma || eka oṃkāreṇa || ekaṃ tūṣṇiṃ juhuyāt ||

<p. 19a> ghṛtāhuti || gaṇa || guru || durggā || kṣetrapāla || vyāhṛti || veda <4> || lokapāla 
<10> || śutikāgnaye svāhā || oṃ mahīdharāya svāhā || oṃ kāmadevāya svāhā || oṃ 
pragalbhāgnaye svāhā || vyāhṛti dhāra <10> || oṃ saptate agne || ghṛtāhuti pūrṇā || 
kṣudra taṇḍūla sarṣapamūlabījamiśrakaṃ juhuyāt || gaṇa || guru || durggā || 
kṣetrapāla || vyāhṛti || veda <4> || lokapāla <10> || śutikāgni || mahīdhara || kāmadeva || 
pragalbhā || vyāhṛti dhāra <10> || saṃkṣāhuti śāntikapuṣṭika || pūrṇā || cekanana 
|| oṃ pūrṇādadarvvipa || āsaṃsā || āśirvvāda || nakakohnuyā thvate || 

nityaṃ dvesaṃdhi velāyāṃ pūjā || ācamya || sūryārgha || gāyatrī nyāsa || 
arghapātrapūjā || ātmapūjā || oṃ tatvājāmi || āsana || oṃ devasya tvā || 
abhyukṣaṇa || oṃ tvā vṛrtte || kāṣṭa abhyukṣaṇa || oṃ indhānāstvā || śiṃtane || 
hnuthvavidhithe homayāya || dhukohnayā || oṃ saṃvarhiraṃ tāguṃna || vedimusra ||

<p. 19b> viditheṃ jajñadhuṃnake || nyāsayāṅāvane pukoṃḍanoṃ balinaṃ 
viśarjanayāya || mepukoṃḍaṣosacuye || iti sutikāgni samāptaḥ ||

tato ṣaṣṭamadivase viṣṇujāgaranārccanaṃ kṛtvā || kumālasnānaṃ || 
keśavānasanyāsayāṅāva baliviśarjanayāṅāvalaṃṣusavāya || nārāyananaṃ 
snānayāṅāvathāparape || nārāyaṇa || kalaśa || janmapatrikā || gaṇa || gogrāsa || 
kumārī || balī || bahiliṃgaṇasthāpya || kumāra aṃguliviye || 
dvāraśakhaṇḍajonake || pradoṣaparata pūjayet || yathāśakti brāhmaṇa 
puṣpabhājana yācake || thaṃkāḍina || oṃ jasya haste || argha || gāyatrīnyāsa || 
arghapātra ātmapūjā || oṃ tatvāyāmi || keśavādi dvādaśaśriyādiśaktaye oṃ 
divovātyādi dvādaśaveda || oṃ śrīścatetyādi śakti ṛcena pūjayet || oṃ 
trātāramiṃdretyādi || viṣṇuratha

<p. 20a> pūjanaṃ || atra gaṃdhādi || kalasapūjā || oṃ brahmayajñānatyādi || oṃ 
ākṛṣṇatyādi || atra gaṃdhādi || janmapatrikāpūjā || oṃ tā asetyādi || oṃ 
aśvasthacotyādi || oṃ arddhamāsetyādi || bahiraṃgaṇapūjā || svasvamaṃtreṇa || 
catusvastityādi || oṃ dhūrasi || oṃ tejosi || devāgre aṣṭottarasatadīpaprajvālya || oṃ 
manojyoti || pratiṣṭhā || jāpa || stotra || brāhmaṇapūjā keśavādi || śāntika paṭhet 
|| svastivācane || oṃ kranikrada || oṃ āśuḥsisona || oṃ jajāgrata || sahasrasīriṣā || oṃ 
agnestanu || oṃ vayatuṃso || jātasthāne ṣaṣṭimaṃdirapūjā || oṃ tatvāyāmi || oṃ 
devasya tvā || oṃ śivāyai nama oṃ viśvataḥ cakṣu || śaṃbhūtyai || oṃ tā guṁ savitu || 
prītyai <2> || oṃ dyāmālekṣī || saṃtatyai <2> || oṃ ambe ambike || anusutāyai || oṃ 
catvāriśṛṃgā || kṣamāyai <2> || oṃ āmidrarīdra || śīrākumālasa ||

<p. 20b> oṃ yatravānā || atra gaṃdhādi || jāpa || stotra || oṃ śivāsaṃbhūti || nāmā 
ca prītisaṃtatireva ca | anusūryākṣamāścaiva ṣaḍete ṣaṣṭi devatā || 
gauryāputro yathā |  skaṃdhaḥ śiśusaṃrakṣaṇastathā | tathā 
mamāpyayaṃvālo rakṣatāṃ ṣaṣṭikena tu || atra gaṃdhādi || nārāyaṇasake 
yajamānasvānataṃnake || bṛhadbhānave arghaṃ nama || oṃ agnimūrddhā || nyāsa 
|| arghapātrapūjā || ātmapūjā || oṃ dyau sānti || śāntika svānaviye || 
svānataṃnake || jāpa || stotra || aṃnasaṃkalpa || dakṣiṇā || bali || metaṃ viśarjana || 
nārāyaṇa hṅavane mohaniphe || kalaśābhiṣeka || caṃdanādi āśirvvāda || 
jātakahlāya mohani hlāya || brāhmaṇasyaṃ || kalaśajātaka || jātasthāna yena || 
brāhmaṇa bhojanaṃ || iti ṣṣṭijāgravidhi samāptaṃ ||

tato pratyuṣavelāyāni kramanaṃ kuryāt ||
jimanehnuko hnuvidhithyaṃ mepukoṃḍa

<p. 21a> (cho kvaloṭa puvā sthānavā kalaguḍi tyaṃcho plakā māsa mvāṭa sesā 
akṣata golaḍo || thvate vasundharā ghaṃ "no yakedraṃ dujuroṃ ||)
homadhūnake nyāsayāṅāvasepukoṃḍahomanaṃ balinaṃ viśarjanayāya || 
balilaṃṣusacchoya || mepukoṃḍasoṣacoya || śithyālakovane coṃgvalohocācelāva 
|| āma atapādevane puvāke kuḍajuchi <1> puvākayādevanākośayetayāva 
vasundharāsvane || ḍoṃḍu || śuṃṭhi cisa bṛhevahanataṃṅa <12> ṅoyake || 
balaṃgataharaṇa ākāsamālaguji <12> vasapethvate || arghanyāsa || arghapātrapūjā || 
oṃ tatvājāmityādi || oṃ imaṃ me gaṃge || āvāhanādi || oṃ ākṛṣṇe || oṃ 
trātāramiṃdra || oṃ asvasthevo || oṃ arddhamāsā || oṃ nakṣatrabhya || oṃ yoge yoge || 
balisa || oṃ ganāṃnātvā || oṃ jātavedase || oṃ imārudrāya || oṃ ghṛtaṃ ghṛtapāvāna 
|| oṃ namo vabhrusāya || agra bali || oṃ viśvataścakṣu || brīhi || oṃ bṛhayaścame || oṃ 
asmākamindra || catusvasti paṭhet oṃ dhurasi || oṃ tejosi || oṃ mano

<p. 21b> jyoti || jāpa || stotra || 
kalasaṃ vasudhārūpaṃ kalārūpena viṣṇunā |
dadhārādhāramakhilaṃ sarvvamāṅgalyakaṃ namaḥ ||

atra gaṃdhādi || oṃ yatravānā || lohocāsa || oṃ yasya kūrmmo || kāpaleśa || oṃ 
ajārepi saṃgilāśvāvitkurupisaṃgilā | śasa āskaṃdamarubhyayi 
paṃthāmvisarpyati || ḍhomacalasasa || oṃ tvaṃjaviṣṭadā || vājana || hāsāsapuvāke 
kuḍajucchite || thelohocā ādina kurmma || pītavastranaṅayakāvahāyathaṃkādina 
|| brāhmaṇasyaṃ svastivācanaṃ paṭhet || hāyadhunaṅāvahlāhlāyane || 
mocāhāye eyolaṅanaphicakaṃ gānaṅayakaṃ moḍakīnitasyaṃ || bhājanaṣiṃ || 
gvayagvaḍavesyaṃṣolāṣiṃ || kaṃḍipuye || bhoṣiṃthāya || veda || oṃ 
aveṣṭādaṃdasukāḥ prācīmāroha gāyatrītvāvaturathaṃtara guṁ 
sāmatrivṛtsomo vasaṃta ṛturbbrahmadraviṇaṃ || dakṣiṇāmārohatriṣṭaptvā 
vatubṛhatsāmapaṃcadaśasomo grīṣma ṛtuḥ kṣatraṃ draviṇaṃ || pratīcī maroha 
jagatī svāvatuvairūpa guṁ

<p. 22a> somasaptadaśastomo varṣā(-)ṛturvvidraviṇaṃ || udīcī mārohānuṣṭuptvā 
catuvairāja gūṁ sāmaikavi guṁ śadastomaḥ śaradṛtuḥ phalaṃ draviṇaṃ || 
ūrddhāmārohapaṃktaistvā catusākvara raivate sāmanītriṇavatrayastri guṁ 
sostomau hemaṃta śiśirāvṛturvvarccodraviṇaṃ pratyastaṃ namuceḥ śiraḥ || 
vājanadiya || mocāmāmanajoṃnake || 
hāsāsacoṃgvakemāmayāgāsaghaḍacecake || piṃluvanne || 
lohocāmocākāpare ḍhomacalasa ṣorāṣiṃ thāyahṅavate jvannakāva || 
piṃluvaṃne || mūladvārasa || ukhe vanakoyakemāla || nṛṣaṃchanādiyāya || 
laṃṣvanahāyake || vālaka || māma || caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || oṃ manojyoti || 
pratiṣṭhā || ārathī || laṃṣvadharayaṃṅadutaṃhe || poḍaceyokehmaseṃhe || 
nanisalaṃṣadhāramaṇḍalasaphalakevote || mitaṃviye || pūrvvādi īśānāntaṃ || 
yāṃ veṣāsaghera

<p. 22b> suyethaṃkādinavālaka || cepakalaṃkacchoya tecaṃvāya || nośicake 
vālakamama || oṃ brahmayajñāna || nikrama || manojyoti pratiṣṭhā || 
sūryadarśanayācake || oṃ tacca kṣurdeva || lāsālāva || thaṃluvaṃne || posoka 
pūjācchoya || 

dakṣiṇā a iti nikramavidhi samāpta || bhiṣeka || 

tato nāmakaraṇaṃ kuryāt ||
pūrvvamukhena kalasthāpanaṃ || gvālasa ghera tayāvagolocanananāmacoyeluṃna 
|| yidisihāsyaṃ kaleśaśatayake || yāvinaṃ sagvana || toṃponaṅa || yevine bali || 
phalakevona || chāsoyātaṃ coke bali || 
hmeyākeleṅanachāsopeṭhadayakāvanāpaṃte || duṃkhāpiṃkhā || 
livanaṃkivoya || ḍvakiṇavalaṃgata harana ākāsamālaguji <12> || gaṇa || gogrāsa || 
komārī || vasape thvate || thaṃkādimyaṃ puṣpabhājanayāṅāva || brāhmaṇa

<p. 23a> syaṃ kalaśārccanayāya vidhitheṃ || jāpa || stotra || brāhmaṇapūjā || 
sāntikapaṭhet || metaṃphaṃ tāḍacā pūjā || lāsālāvahe || mothaṃkādina || 
vaṃsocakaṃte || nṛvaṃcchanayāya mithaṃkādina || arghapātra laṃkhanahāya || 
svānataṃnake || dyau śānti svānaviye || metaṃphaṃ tāḍacāsagvananatvāya 
mithaṃkādinī || arghapātralaṃṣanahāya || vastraviye || yeyotāṃgva balisacchāya 
|| caṃdanādiśagvanaviye || gvālasacoṃgva ghelanadvāya || kāyajurasāja 
vahnasasa || hmyācajurasāṣa vahnasasanāmakaṃne || nosicakāva ghelasuya || 
paṃcagrāsamantrana || brāhmaṇa svastivācana paṭhet || āganacchāyāva 
ucchiṣṭakalaṃkacchoya || leṅaghelanaṃ gvālanaṃ jātasthānasate || nāmakaraṇa 
āśīrvvāda || oṃ kāya svāhā kusau svāhā katamasmai svāhā 
svāhādhimādhitāya svāhā || manaḥ prajāpataye svāhā(?) cittaṃ 
vijñātāyādityai

<p. 23b> svāhā || dityai mahyai svāhā dityai sumṛḍīvāyai svāhā || sarasvatyai 
svāhā || sarasvatyai pāvakāyai svāhā || sarasvatyai bṛhatyai svāhā || pūṣṇe 
svāhā || pūṣṇaprapathyāya svāhā || puṣṇanaraṃdhiṣāya svāhā || tvaṣṭre 
svāhā || tvaṣṭre turīpāya svāhā || tvaṣṭre pururūpāya svāhā || viṣṇave svāhā 
|| viṣṇave nibhūyapāya svāhā || viṣṇavasiṣiviṣṭāya svāhā || manojyoti 
pratiṣṭhā || annasaṃkalpa || dakṣīnā || vācanalaṃṣakalesasate || brāhmaṇādi atra 
gaṃdhādi || kalaśa āśīrvvāda || nyāsayāṅāva baliviśarjana || thaṃkāḍi 
ādina kalaśābhiṣeka || caṃdanādi sagvana āśīrvvāda || arathī || komārī 
darśana || pūrṇacaṃdra || varaṃgata dvārasate || ḍokeviya || sākṣithāya || 
thaṃkādi ādi namo cāhlāya || 

iti nāmakaraṇavidhi samāptaḥ ||

<p. 24a> tato ṣaṭmāse phalaprāsana annaprāsanaṃ kārayet || hṅathvakohnuyinakose 
sādharivometaṃ dayakaṃ yāveṣākoke || kumāra snāna || kaleśa || śagvana || 
gaṇa || gogrāsa || komārī || vahiraṃgaṇa || kevocoya || tavapitinīsabheruraṅate || 
sagvanasapalilaṅate || bhuśate khagoḍacā || puvā || puthi || alaṃkārate || 
grahamālākalaśaśate || 

āditya raktapāṣānaṃ vaca saumya tathaiva ca | 
kuṭamaṃgārakaṃ jñayaṃ śrīṣarṇavudhameva ca || 
yuttaṃjali guruṃ vidyāṃ dajagaṃdhaṃ tu bhārggava 
lauhaṃ śanaiścaraṃ vidyātphaṇīrāhustathaiva ca || 
māmsikaṃ ca tathā ketumityatāgrahamālikā || 
siddhārthavaka pusyaṃ ca priyaṃgu nāgakeśaraṃ |
dūrvvākṣata samāyuktaṃ madhye kuṇḍali pūrakaṃ ||
suvarṇṇarūpatāmrāni tridevati prakīrttitāḥ | 
ādityādi kramenaiva sthāne sthāne pradāpayet ||

<p. 24b> vaśapethvate || <7> || thaṃkādina puṣpabhājana || brāhmaṇasyaṃ 
kalasārccana vidhithe || jāpa || stotra || brāhmaṇa pūjā || śāntika paṭhet || 
metaṃphaṃ tāḍacā pūjā || kumāralāsālahe || svastikāsane pūrvvamukha 
sthitvā mātā saha || nṛvaṃcchana || arghapātra laṃṣanahāya || svānataṃnake || 
dyau śāntina svānaviye || metaṃphaṃ tāḍacā sagvananahnā(?)ya || caṃdanādi 
sagvana āśīrvvāda brāhmaṇādi sṛpitiniviya || tavapitinīnatvāya || 
parepatithāsāmāḍhe pitinisate || āganacchāya || kapūra goyamani 
bherunaṅanaphicakaṃ phalaprāsana || sepitinamāga yātāte || 
ucchiṣṭakaraṃkacchoya || āśīrvvāda || yāphalalanina || pratiṣṭhā || oṃ manojyoti || 
sagvananadvāya || paḍinaṅaviye || caṃdanādiśagvana āśīrvvāda || 
grahamālāviye || brāhmaṇa aṃnasaṃkalpa jātupūjāyāya || 

<p. 25a> oṃ tatvājāmi || āsana || oṃ devasyatvā || abhyukṣaṇa || oṃ tvamagnedyuti || oṃ 
prajāpate || oṃ namojyoti || pratiṣṭhā || haṃsayā agnikāya || paṃḍu haṃsapūjā 
|| oṃ īrmmāntāsaḥ silika madhyamāsaḥ sa gūṁ suraṇyaso divyāso atyā | ha gūṁ 
sā ivaśrenisojaṃ jantejadāṣiṣurddivyamasmat svāhā || tvāthanatvāthathiyake || 
jātūnaṭvāya || thāsāmāḍhe svastikasajābhote || śrīvatsa ādina 
aṣṭamaṃgalanaṅāyake || āganate || aṃnaprāsana || paṃcagrāsamaṃtra || 
brāhmaṇasyaṃ svastivācana || sogvanadharivāre || virakakavalakāya <3> || jātu 
māmayātaṃte || ucchiṣṭa aṣṭamaṃgalaṃnaṃ karaṃkacchoya || laṃkhanahāya || 
brahmaṇadakṣiṇā || vācana || kalaśa āśīrvvāda || balivisarjjana || thaṃkādi 
ādina kalasābhiṣeka || caṃdanādi śagvana āśīrvvāda || sephaṃ || ārathī || 
komārī darśaṇa || pūrṇacaṃdra || sākṣithāya || mocāpiṃtāyana || kuḍajucchike 
āsanamālajanakosaḥ || iti phalaprāsana aṃnaprāsanavidhi samāptaḥ ||

<p. 25b> phalaprāsana annaprāsana pratyārambhanavidhi ||
tavapiṭinisa paḍiṭoṃpote || sagvanasapaḍiṭopote || hṅathvakohnu 
āsanayāṅāpuvākena māḍhanepācchuyajātu sadyaṃ tejo tu natvāya || 
māḍhanaṃ kaṃṭhaṣoya || paṃcagrāsa ādinanake || ucchiṣṭakaraṃkacchoya || 
pūjāvidhi hṅathvakohnuyātheṃ || iti kaṇṭhaṣovidhi ||

tato cūḍākaraṇaṃ kṛtvā || divasasoyāva || pithipūjā || brahmāduṃkāya || 
hṅathvakohnu || lusiṃpāya prohita ādina mālako cāpūjāvane || javodakayāya || 
kumāralāsāladutaṃhe || svastikāsane pūrvvamukhaṃ sthitvā || nṛvaṃcchanādi 
lokopacāraṃ kṛtvā sarabhṛṃdikāvāya || śikhāsaluṃ aṃgulicesetāthe || 
caṃdanādi āśirvvāda || pratiṣṭhā || sephaṃ ārathi || māsagheḍe || lāsālavuṃ 
duṃsalajānake kumāra || thvate hṅathvakohnuyāvidhi

<p. 26a> saṃtikohnuyāvasapevidhi || 

brahmā aṣṭakalasa || nāgapoṃ yakṣa yakṣanī || śrīlakṣmī || yajñavidhi 
svānalāhālanathiyake || yināyakāya || aniniphaninakāya || yodakayāye || 
brahmāpūjāyācake || śivācāryena || ghaṃthaṃne vidhitheṃ || kumārasocchāya 
|| nṛvaṃcchanādi kṛtvā || kevaṃphaṃ || tāḍacā || sagona || prostauta(?)liminaṭvoya || 
śucchāya || caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || pratiṣṭhā || sephaṃ || ārathī || māsadyeḍe 
|| lāsālāvayeneliviśa || upatanayāya || moṃḍahluyake ||

agnikāryyayāya || yathā <2> vidhimaṃtrena brāhma aṣṭakalaśapūjā || 
bahiraṃgaṇādi pūjā || arthapadāsādhana || agnidaśakriyā || agnināma || oṃ 
sadbhyognaye svāhā || ghṛtāhutī || tilāhuti || saṃkṣāhuti tāṃ dhunake || 
tāṃmrapātrasa laṃkhacchuye agnikuṇḍa

<p. 26b> sepitāpiṃkāyāva devanaṃnite || thedadhi svetatilacchuye uṣṇodakasa || tato 
kumāramātā saha ānayet || yajñasyottara bhāge svastikāsane upaviśya || 
nṛvaṃcchadādi || pitā sitodakaṃ gṛhītvā || uṣṇodakabhājane āsiṃcanamatra || oṃ 
uṣṇena vāyu udakena hṛdite keśāṃnvapet || puna pitā uṣṇodakaṃ gṛhītvā || 
kumārasya śirasi dakṣaṇabhāge lepanamaṃtra || oṃ savitā prasūtā devyā āpa 
udaṃtute tanuṃ cūsavarāna saṃkhiye maṃtra || oṃ dīrghāyustvā || kusapusya 
duṃvarisiṃ saṃsuceya maṃtra || oṃ oṣadhetrāya svasvadhitamaituṃ hituṃ sāṃḥ 
|| sūpapūjā || mupanakṣurakāya maṃtra || oṃ śivo nāmāśistaditistepitā namaste 
astu mātāhi guṁ sī || saṃthiyakaṃte kṣurena maṃtra || oṃ 
nivarttayāmyāyuṣennādyāya prajananāya rāyasyoṣāya suprajāstvāya 
suvīryāya ||

<p. 27a> keśachedanamantra || oṃ yenāvat savitākṣureṇa somasya rājño varuṇasya 
vidvān | tena brahmaṇo vapatedamasyāyuṣyaṃ jaradastiryathāsat || chedya || 
saṃphayakeninina || puvāgomayalimisate || punaḥ paścimabhāge dātavyamaṃtra 
|| oṃ savitāprasūtā devyā āpa udaṃtute tanuṃ || cusicarānasaṃkheye maṃtra 
|| oṃ dīrghāyustvā || kuśapuspaduṃvarireye maṃtra || oṃ oṣadhetrāyasva || oṃ 
śivānāmāśi || punamupanasaṃḍane maṃtra || oṃ triyāyuṣaṃjamadagne || 
gomayabhāṇḍe nidhāye || punasyottara bhāge dātavya maṃtra || oṃ savitā 
prasuvitā devyā āpa udaṃtute tanuṃ || cusivarānasaṃkheyematra || oṃ 
dīrghāyustvā || kuśapuṣpadumvarīsaṃsacaye maṃtra || oṃ oṣadhe trāyasva || oṃ 
śivo nāmāśi || oṃ nivṛrttayāsyāyuṣe || saṃḍene maṃtra || oṃ yena 
tūriścarādivaṃ jyokca paścādhisūryaṃ | tenate vapāsi brahmaṇā jīvā

<p. 27b> tave jīvanāya suślokyāya svastaye || chedya || gomayabhāṇḍe nidhāya kesa 
|| pūrvve ūrddha tuṣṇiṃ chedayet keśaṃ || gomaya bhāṇḍe nidhāye || 
karṇābheda maṃtra || oṃ bhadraṃ karṇebhi || tataḥ kumāra saśire || 
kṣūrabhramaṇaṃ || oṃ yatkṣūreṇa majjayatāsupetasāvaplāvovapatikeśān 
chindhi śiro māsyāyuḥ pramoṣī || mupananopika caṃdramaṇḍala 
kṣuratayāvahlāyamaṃtra || oṃ akṣunnaṃ parivapet || nāpikena śiṣo vāhikena 
sarvvaṃ chedayet || gomaya bhāṇḍa nidhāya || samudra vāhayet keśa || kumāra 
snānaṃ || moṃḍasagolocananatale || lāsālahe || yajñasiṃhāsane dakṣinabhāge 
svastikāsana upaviśya || nṛvaṃcchaṇādi || arghapātra laṃṣanahāya || 
svānataṃnake || metaṃphaṃ || tāḍacā sagonanaṃṭvāya || vastraviye || 
caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || moṃḍasasostikacoya || bhoyumalanaphoya || 
sarabhaṃḍikāna koṣāyake || cāka

<p. 28a> laphaninacchāya || kuhmarakānayite <3> || pāṭanayine <3> || anininaṭvāya || 
hāsānagāle || pasādapitiniviye || vaṃdāvanacchuya || āhuti <10> oṃ mūrddhānaṃ 
divo aratiṃ vṛthivyā vaiśvānara mṛta ājātamagnin kavi guṁ samrājamatithiṃ 
janānāmāsaṃnā pātraṃ janayaṃta devā || oṃ bhadraṃ karṇebhi || oṃ manojyoti || 
pratiṣṭhā || sephaṃ || ārathi || māsagheḍe || lāsālāvathaṃtaṃyane || 
phaninavajinake || brāhmaṇa pūjā || śāntika || puṣṭika || yavadhānyādi || 
aṃnasaṃkalpa || dakṣināpūrṇā || āśaṃśā || āśīrvvāda || baliharaṇa || 
brahmā abhiseṣa || caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || yajñavisarjana || kumāli darśana || 
kaleśahlāya || yināyahlāya || brahmā laṃṣanaluye || iti cūḍākararṇavidhi 
samāptaḥ ||

atha vaṭukarmma || divasasoyāvapūrvva 

<p. 28b> sevācchoya || pithipūjā || brahmā duṃkāye || hṅathvakohnulusiṃpāya || 
prohita adinamālako || cāpūjāvane || yodakayāya || lāsālahe || svānataṃnake || 
metaṃphaṃ || tāḍacā || sagvana || naṭvāya || sarabhaṃḍikāvāya || candanādi || 
āśīrvvāda || oṃ manojyoti || pratiṣṭhā || mepha ārathi || māsagheḍe || 
lāsālāvathaṃtaṃyanne || duṃśalajānake || thvakohnuyāvidhi thvate juroṃ ||

saṃtikohnuyāvidhi || brahmākalaśa || nāgaghaṃ || yakṣa yakṣīṇī || śrīlakṣmī || 
vahiraṃgaṇa pūrvvadiśathāpaḍape || homavidhi || palāsadaṇḍa || 
gaṃbhālirisiṃkvaṃ || kālasācarmma || yogapāṭa || micakiṃhnasa || muṃjaḍola || 
bhokholātahaṃḍagha || luṃ aṃguli || oho aṃguli || vastra || thvate vasape ||

<p. 29a> yināyakāya || anina || phanina || kāya || yodakayāya || brahmāpūjāyāya 
|| ṭinina || dyaṃthaṃne vidhithe pūrvvādi || succhāya || yaṃkulisa || nṛvaṃcchana || 
arghapātra laṃṣanahāya || svānataṃnake || metaṃphaṃ || tāḍacā || 
sagvananaṭvāya || prokṣaṇa liminaṭvāya || succhāya || oṃ kāṃḍātkāndā || koḍa || 
oṃ dīrghāyustvā || caṃdramandranaṭvāya || navahlāya || caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || 
pratiṣṭhā || sephaṃ || ārathi || māsagheḍe || lāsālāvahleṅesa svastikasate || 
upatanayācake || nakhacchedanayācake || moḍaśaṃkhācake || snānayācake || tato 
yajñasiṃhāsane dakṣiṇabhāge || svastikasate pūrvvāmukhaṃ upaviśya || 
nṛvaṃcchanādilokopacāraṃ kṛtvā || vastrālaṃkāraviye || phaninacchāye || oṃ 
trātāramiṃdra sarabhaṃḍikāna 

<p. 29b> koṣāyake || oṃ ākṛṣṇe || caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || anininaṭvāya || oṃ śivo 
nāmāsi || hāsānagāle || oṃ tavavāyu vṛhaspato || prasādapiṭiniviya || 
vādāvanacchuye || pratiṣṭhā || oṃ manojuti sephaṃ ārathi || māsagheḍe || 
lāsālāvathaṃtāyaṃne || phanina vajinake || dadhilājā || ucchoṭacchoyā || 
phaninakoṭoya || 

gurusyaṃ agnikāryayāya || brahmādi aṣṭakalaśārcana pūjayet || 
arthapadāsādhanaṃ || upayamanakusamādāya || agnidaśakarmma kuryyāt || 
agnināma || oṃ samudbhavāgnaye svāhā || agnidhyāna || ṣoḍasasamidhahoma || 
pūrvvāghāra uttarāghāra || upayamanakuśena haste veṣṭayet || tato vaṭurācamya 
ānayet || yajñasiṃhāsane uttarabhāge upavisya || gurusyaṃ vaṃsoya ||

<p. 30a> vaṭusyaṃyosoye || gurupūjā || idamāsnaṃ || puṣpa || pādārgha || hastārgha 
|| caṃdana || yajñopavita puṣpa || dhūpa dīpa || vaṭukarmmanimityārthena 
gurumūrtta atra gaṃdhādi || hastapramānamaṃḍalaṃ kuryāt || gaṃdhacaṃdanena 
abhyukṣaṇaṃ || oṃ madhukaiṭabhamedena bharitā pṛthivītale | 
tadoṣasamanārthāya śiṃcāmi gaṃdhavāriṇā || hastena bhūmi lepanaṃ || 

sodhitā pṛthivīścaiva gaṃdhavāruṇalepitā |
pūrvvajanmakṛtaṃ pāpaṃ duḥkṛtaṃ suḥkṛtaṃ tathā || 
iha janmani pāpānāṃ ehi janmāntareṣu ca |
veṣṭitaṃ karmmaśūtrāṇāṃ janmajanmāntareṣu ca ||
karapṛṣṭāṃjaliṃ kṛtvā bhrāmayet kara cetasā |
akhaṃḍamaṇḍalodbhūta gurusyāgre vibhinvayet ||
puṣpaṃ ca vividhākāraṃ jāyante vividhe kule |
tatsarvvaṃ kṣamyatāṃ deva rakṣantu śiva sarvvadā ||

pāṭavāsanamaṇḍala <3> || kevovoya || piṃthva |

<p. 30b> indrādi <10> || dathoyayādi <8> || duṃthva sadyojātādi <5> || madhya tridevatā || <3> || 
cetate || siṃdhrate || jajamakā || se svāna tāṃbūla te || maṇḍalasa svānataṃnake || 
voyātheṃvupūjanaṃ || oṃ brahmamaṇḍalāya nama || oṃ viṣṇumaṃḍalāya nama 
|| oṃ rudramaṇḍalāya nama || oṃ caṃdramaṇḍalāya nama || agnimaṇḍalāya nama 
|| oṃ gurumaṃḍalāya nama || dhūpa || dīpa || stotra || 

maṇḍalāya namastubhyaṃ sarvvatatvādhipāya ca |
bhūrbhūvasva prakāsāya maṇḍalāya namostute || 

atra gaṃdhādi || dakṣinā || puspāṃjaliṃ vadhvā vaṭupaṭhati maṃtra || 
oṃ brahmacaryatvadhikāraṃ dehi me tvat kṛpāṃ kuru |
vidhānaṃ caiva gurvvājñā pālayāmi mayā prabho ||
ajñāna paśupiṇḍasya dehi me jñānabhaktikaṃ ||
vikārasmatsarīraṃ tu pāpasaṃcaya saṃbhavaṃ |
tatsarvvaṃ kṛpayā deva nāśayatvaṃ prayatnataḥ ||
gāyatryā pūta dehaṃ ca brahmacaryyercca varddhaye |

<p. 31a> brahmaṇokta prataṃ baṃdhaṃ svādhyāyaṃ caiva dehi me ||
śīlasauca tapajñānaṃ pālayāmi tavājñayā ||
iti pathitvā namaskṛtya || 

maṇḍala viśarjanaṃ || ācārjana paṭhati || oṃ brahmacaryamāgāmu || vaṭu 
paṭhati oṃ brahmacaryamāgāmi || ācārya na paṭhati || oṃ brahmacaryasānī || vaṭu 
paṭhati || oṃ brahmacaryasāni || vaṭuvaṃsocakaṃ te || kuśākṣata āsanasate 
gurusyaṃ yusoya || vaṭu abhyukṣaṇa maṃtra || oṃ āpo asmānmātare || vaṭu śiraśi 
gayatrī yapeta || <10> || 
vaṭu adhauvāsa pariharanamācāryena paṭhati maṃtra || 
oṃ yenendrāya bṛhaspatirvvāsaḥ paryadadhādamṛtaṃ |
tena svāpari dadhāmpāyuṣe dīrghāyustvāya valāya vaccase ||

iti meṣalā baṃdhanaṃ || muṃjabaṃdhanaṃ dviguni triguṇī veṣṭayet maṃtra || 
pratama graṃthi || maṃtra || oṃ iyaṃ duriktaṃ parivādhamānā varṇapavitraṃ puna 
tīma āgāt | prānāpānābhyāṃ valamādadhānā | śvi

<p. 31b> sādevī śubhagā mekhalepaṃ || amukagotra amukasarmmāhaṃ bho 
brahmacaryasāni || dvitīya granthi maṃtra || oṃ iyaṃ duriktaṃ || oṃ ṛtasya gopti 
tapasaḥ sarasvi | pratirakṣāḥ sahamā anātrī || amuka gotrādi || tṛtīya granthi 
maṃtra || oṃ iyaṃ duriktaṃ || oṃ samāsamaṃtamabhiḥ payahi bhajadhārttārabhe | 
mekhale mārīṣāyaḥ || amukagotrādi || gāyatrī maṃtrena japet || oṃ 
brahmayajñānaṃ || oṃ viṣṇorarāṭa || oṃ nama saṃbhavāya || 
maṃjuvāsanamaṃtra || oṃ vaso pavitra || jonāviya gāyatrī maṃtrena nyāsa || 
ācāryana urcārya || 
oṃ yajñopavitaṃ paramaṃ pavitraṃ prajāpatena yatsahajaṃ purastāt | 
tenatvā pratimuṃcāmyāyuṣe brahmavarccasoya || 
vaṭukena dhāraṇamaṃtra || 
āyuṣyamagraṃ pratimuṃca śubhraṃ yajñopavītaṃ valamastu teja ||

<p. 32a> kṛṣṇājinaviye maṃtra || 
oṃ mitrasya cakṣurvvaruṇambalīyastejo yaśaguṃsphaviraṃjuṣasva |
anāhamasmiṃ vacanaṃ viniṣṭaḥ paritaṃ vājinaṃ dhehi || 

laṅaviye maṃtra || 
oṃ yasasāmādyā vā pṛthivi yasase drāya bṛhaspati |
yaso bhagaśca movi sadyat somā pratipadyatāṃ || 
gāmiyamaṃtra ||
oṃ yuvāsuvāsāḥ parivītamogāte || satuchrayāṃ bhavati jāyamānaḥ taṃ na 
dhīrāḥ sakavaya uṃnvayaṃti sādhyo manasā devayaṃta || yogavāṭaviyamaṃtra 
|| oṃ yoge yoge tavastaraṃ || ḍaṇḍakaṭhi kṛsnīnaviya || vaṭuḍaṇḍaṃ gṛhītvā 
paṭhati maṃtra || oṃ yo me daṇḍaḥ parāpatadvaihāya sodhi bhūmyāṃ | tamahaṃ 
vunarādada āyuṣe brahmaṇe brahmavarccasāyaḥ || koṃ pativiye mantra || oṃ 
bhadrāno agnirāhuti bhadrārātiḥ śubhagabhadroḍādhvaraṃ | bhadrā 
utapraśastaya || suvarṇarajatamudrikā pradāna maṃtra || hiraṇyarūpā

<p. 32b> uṣaso virogā ubhāmindrāmudiṭha sūryasya | 
ārohataṃ varuṇamitragataṃ tadaśca kṣātāmiditiditiṃ ca mitro śivarunosi ||
micakiṃ na suyake maṃtra || oṃ gāva upāvanāvataṃ mahī yajñasya rapsudā | 
ubhākarṇā hiraṇyayāṃ || bho khoro viyamaṃtra || oṃ dīrghāyustvā || 
tāhāḍaghaṃviyamaṃtra || oṃ svasti na indro || kuśa aṃguliviye maṃtra || oṃ 
pavitrestho || ācāryena vaṭuhastana udakaṃ dadyāt || vaṭu paṭhati udaka snānaṃ 
|| oṃ āpā hṛṣṭāmayo || dvitīya snana || oṃ yo vaḥ śivatamorasa || tṛtīya snānaṃ || oṃ 
tasmā araṃgamāmavo || vaṭu śirasiṃcayet || ācāryena udakāṃjaliṃ dadyāt || 
vaṭu ādityamīkṣyanamaṃtra || oṃ urutyaṃ jātavedasaṃ || oṃ citraṃ devānāṃ || oṃ 
tacca kṣūrddevahitaṃ || vaṭutilakaṃ datvā || gaṃgamṛttikā || cita 

<p. 33a> cule maṃtra || oṃ aśvakrānte rathakrānte || cetanatecake maṃtra || oṃ 
jadadyakacavitra || vaṭuhṛdayālaṃbhana maṃtra || oṃ mama vratate hṛdayaṃ 
dadhāmi mama citta manucittaṃ te astu || mama vācamekamanāyuṣa sva 
bṛhaspatistvāniyunaktu mahyaṃ || punarācāryena brahmacāriṇo dakṣiṇahastaṃ 
gṛhītvā pṛcchet || ko nāmāsi || veṭu uttaraṃ dadyāt || amukagotra amukanāma 
sarmmāhaṃ bho || ācāryena paṭhati maṃtra || kasya brahmacāryasi || vaṭu paṭhati || 
bhavataḥ || ācāryena || indrasya brahmacāryasi || vaṭu paṭhati || bhavataḥ || 
ācāryena || agvirācāryasi || vaṭu || bhavataḥ || ācāryena || ahamācāryestavāṃsau 
|| vaṭu bhavaṭaḥ || ācāryena vaṭu dakṣinahastaṃ gṛhītvā || ācāryyasya 
daṣiṇahastena || vāmahastena udakaṃ dadyāt ācāryena pathati maṃtra || oṃ 
prajāpataye tvāpari dadāmi || devāya tvāsaviḍe paridadāmi ||

<p. 33b> adbhyastoṣadhībhyaḥ paridadāmi || padyāvā pṛthivībhyāṃ 
tvāparidadāmi || uviśvasyastvā devebhyaḥ paridadāmi || urddha 
sarvvebhyastvādbhūtebhyaḥ paridadāmi || adha paścāt ācāryena vaṭu hastaṃ 
gṛhītvā || agnimaṃdapaṃ pradakṣinī kṛtvā || ācāryasya dakṣiṇabhāge vaṭu 
upaviśya || ācāryena prāṅmukhena savyana ācāryasya dakṣiṇabāhu dve 
kumbhenavagukena puśet || tato agnidevārccanaṃ || tato prajāpati devatā 
mānasaṃciṃtya || tṛpaṃcayāruṇī vedāhuti || saṃsravana nidhāya || ghṛtāhuti || 
ghṛtāhutipūrṇā || tilāhuti datvā || kalasapratiṣṭhā || saṃkṣāhuti || āhuti || oṃ 
yathemāṃ vācaṃ kalpānī mā vadānijanebhya || brahmarājanyābhyā guṁ 
śūdrāya cāryāya ca svāya cāruṇāya ca | priyo devānāṃ dakṣiṇāyai dātu 
riha bhūyā samayaṃ mekāmaḥ samṛdhyatāmupamādo namatu svāhā ||

<p. 34a> upanayanaṃ || tataḥ vaṭubhyo'nusāsanaṃ ācāryeṇa bruyāt || 
brahmacāryasi || vaṭu paṭhati || vāḍhaṃ || punarācāryena || āposāna karmma kuru 
|| ācāryena || ācārya karmma kuryā || vaṭu pathati || vāḍhaṃ || ācāryena || 
mādirāsvapihi || vaṭuvāḍhaṃ || ācāryena || rācaṃ yaccha || samidhamādhehi || 
nitya snāyī bhava || trisaṃdhyopāsanaṃ kuru || agnipūjanaṃ || vaṭuvāḍhaṃ || 
punarācāryena || madhumāṃsavarjanaṃ || agamyāgamamavarjyaṃ || 
guruśuśruṣanaṃ || daṇḍadhāranaṃ || vedapāṭhanaṃ || 
yāvadbhārddrapadamāsaṃ tāvadvrataṃ caret || vaṭuvāḍhaṃ || punarācāryena || 
gurusthāne upānahachatravarjanaṃ || uccāvarohanaṃ ucca vākyaṃ || 
mātsaryādayo varjanīyā || śayyāśayanaṃ strīgamanaṃ || adattādānavarjanaṃ 
|| ete varjanīyaṃ || vaṭuvāḍhaṃ || tato'gaṃ sādhanaṃ gāyatreṇa prathame 
pranavaṃ || vaṭu udakaṃ datvā || dakṣiṇanāsena nītvā || vāmanāsena 
revaciṣṭān || pranava pradānaṃ || oṃ gāyatrī pradānaṃ || 

<p. 34b> oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svaḥ tatsaviturvvaraṇyaṃ || puna dvitīyaṃ sāvitrī 
pradānaṃ || oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svaḥ bharggo devasya dhīmahi || punaḥrttritīya 
sarasvatī pradānaṃ || oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ sva dhico yonaḥ pracodayāt || ete gāyatrī 
maṃtra || āhutiviye || brahmajajñānaṃ || oṃ viṣṇorarāṭa || oṃ namaḥ saṃbhavāya 
ca || āhuti || gāyatrī || oṃ eṣate gāyatro bhāga iti me somāya vrutādeṣate 
traiṣṭabhobhāga iti me somāya vrutādeṣate jāgato bhāga tī me somāya 
vrūtācchaṃdo nāmānā guṁ sāmprājyaṃ gacchati me somāya 
vrūtādāsmākosi śukraste grahyo vicitastvā viciṃtvaṃ tu svāhā || pratiṣṭhā 
|| oṃ manojuti gāyatrī pradānaṃ || tato vaṭu ajñāri karmmaṅkuyāt || 
udakakenāgniṃ prajukṣanaṃ || paṃcakāṣṭaṃ juhuyāt || oṃ agne suśravaḥ 
saṃsuśravaḥ saṃ mā kuru svāhā || oṃ yathā tvamagne suśravaḥ suśravā asi 
svāhā || oṃ evamā gūṁ suśravaḥ sauśrava saṃmo kuru svāhā || oṃ yathātvaṃ 
devānāṃ yajñasya

<p. 35a> nidhipā asi svāhā || oṃ evamaha manuṣyānāṃ vedasya nidhipo bhūyāsa 
guṃ svāhā || agniṃ prajuṣya utiṣṭena karṇampṛṣṭvā japatiḥ maṃtraḥ || 
samidhena || oṃ agne samidha mahā(-)ṛkṣaṃ bṛhatte jātavedaśe || yathātvamagne 
samidhā samidhyasi | evamahamāyuṣāmedhayā varcasā prajayā 
paśubhirbbrahmavarcasena samiṃdho jīve putro mamācāryo medhāṃ 
vyahamasānya nirākariṣṭaryasasvī tejasvī brahmavarccasaṃ nādo bhūyāsa gūṁ 
svāhā || ekaṃ evaṃ dvitīyaṃ tathā tritīyaṃ || puna agniṃ prajuṣya || puna agne 
suśraveti paṃcakāṣṭaṃ juhuyāt || puna agniṃ prajukṣa || ghṛtāhuti || tilāhuti 
juhoti || tato pūrṇā || ā brahmaṃ brāhmaṇe || oṃ prathamā dvitīyai || āsaṃsā || 
maṃtrārthā saṃtu || oṃ saṃvaraṃhiraṃtāguṃ atha pāṇīya tarpanaṃ || oṃ 
tanūpāgnesi || atha medhā karaṇaṃ || oṃ medhāmme deva savitā ādadhātu 
medhā devī sarasvatī ādadhātuṃ |

<p. 35b> medhāmāśvano devā vādhattāyuskaruraśrajau || atha aṃgapṛset || oṃ 
aṃgāniścama āpyāyatāṃ vākprāṇa cakṣuḥ śrotraṃ yasobalaṃ || atha 
bhasmatilakaṃ kārayet || oṃ tryāyukhaṃ jamadagneti || paścāṅgotra 
pravaramurccārayet || amuka sarmmāhaṃ bho samudbhavāgne abhivādayāmi || 
iṣṭadevatābhyo ||

sarvvān devān ṛṣīn gurun gotrān abhivādayāmi || pitṛn mātṛn abhivādayāmi 
|| oṃ agni ṛṣī || agni āśīrvvāda || oṃ vratena dīkṣāmāpnoti dīkṣayāpnoti 
dakṣiṇām dakṣiṇā śraddhāmāpnoti śraddhayā satyamāpyate || ātmā 
āśīrvvāda || vaṭubhikṣā karaṇaṃ || bhavatu bhikṣāṃ dehi || oṃ svasti 
prativākyaṃ || mātu bhikṣāṃ dadyāt || sarvvalokyena dadyāt || ācārye nīvedayet 
|| atha vaṭu bodhavyā || ahaḥśeṣabhikṣā || niyamānasekhabhakṣaṃ || atha 
sajyāśayanaṃ 

<p. 36a> trirātra akṣāra lavaṇaṃ bhojanamādayo aneka bodhayāvyā || 
yāvadbhādrapadamāse tāvat maunaṃ tiṣṭayet vaṭuvāḍhaṃ || metat guruvacana 
kārayedvaṭu || brāhmaṇa pūjā || śāntika pauṣṭika || dinasaṃrṇā || oṃ 
pūrṇādarvvi || tato sūryanakṣatra varjite || vaṭu aparāhna saṃdhyāṅkṛtvā || puna 
yajñasvāye ācāryasyaṃ vaṭu ajñārikarmmaṃ kuryāt mantra pūrvvavat || tata 
śāntikaḥ pauṣṭika || śeṣahoma || yavadhānyādi || annasaṃkalpa || dakṣiṇā || 
pūrṇā || oṃ āpyāya svasame || āsaṃsā || baliharanaṃ || āśīrvvāda || 
yajñavisarjana || tavo bhikṣāsevanaṃ uthāya vaṭu mātu annaṃ dadyāt || 
māturbhavati bhikṣām dehi || oṃ svasti udakaṃ || bhumau nidhāya || udakena pātra 
veṣṭana maṃtra || oṃ ratyaṃ || oṃ satya oṃ siṃcyaṃ || agra paṃcacālipradānaṃ 
matra || oṃ pṛthvi nama || oṃ pṛthvirājāya nama || oṃ prajāpataye nama ||

<p. 36b> oṃ agnaye nama || oṃ śrīyai nama || bhūtabalipradānaṃ || oṃ bhūpataye 
svāhā || oṃ bhuvanapataye svāhā || bhūtānāṃpataye svāhā || oṃ pitṛpataye 
svāhā || oṃ balipataye svāhā || annapātra japati maṃtra || āposāna maṃtra || 
oṃ antaścarati bhūteṣu guhāyāṃ viśvato mukhaḥ |
svaṃ yajñaṃ tvaṃ vaṣaṭkāra āpo jyotirasomṛtaṃ svāhā ||
annaprāsana maṃtra || oṃ prāṇāya svāhā || oṃ apānāya svāhā || oṃ vyānāya 
svāhā || oṃ udānāya svāhā || oṃ samānāya svāhā || iti paṃcagrāsa || 
punācamanaṃ || oṃ amṛtopidhānamasi svāhā || 
tato yatheṣṭaṃ bhojayet || iti vratabaṃdhavidhiḥ samāptaḥ ||

tato vedāraṃbhavidhi ||
vaṭunityakarmma kuryāt || vedāraṃbhanimityuka ābhyudaikaṃ kṛtvā || ācāryena 
kuśaṇḍikarmma kuryāt || yathā yathā vidhimaṃtrena || brahmākalaśapūjā || 
artha padāsādhanāṃte || agne daśakarmma ||

<p. 37a> agnināma || samudbhavāgnaye svāhā || paṃcavārunānte || ghṛtāhuti 
sarvve ghṛtāhuti pūrṇā || tilāhuti || tataḥ svasvavadanatilāhuti sarvve dadyāt || 
kalaśa pratiṣṭhā || saṃkṣāhuti || tato yajñasiṃhāsane uttarabhāge || 
vaṭuvratavinivarttanaṃ adho cāsa ādina || gurumaṃḍalathele jathāvidhi || 
yajñasiṃhāsane dakṣinabhāge tiṣṭhati || ācāryavubhayoḥ pituraṇyasya vā || 
idaṃ karmma tasmai dhyāyane adhikāra || tato vedāraṃbha || vaṭu pūrvvamukha || 
ācārya paścimamukha vaṭu vedadikṣā pradānaṃ || pranava gāyatrī oṃ 
samidhāgniṃ || oṃ iṣetvā || iti vedadīkṣā || āhuti || iṣetvā || vaṭu ajñāri karmma 
kuryāt maṃtra pūrvvavat || 

tata prajāpati sṛṣṭikṛta juhuyāt || brāhmana pūjā || śāntika pauṣṭika || 
yavadhānyādi || annasaṃkalpa || dakṣinā śaṃśrava prāsanaṃ || pavitra mocanaṃ 
|| pūrṇā āsaṃsā || āśīrvvāda || yajñavisarjana ||

<p. 37b> brahmākalasābhiṣeka || āśīrvvāda || brahmālaṃkhanaluye || yināyahlāya 
|| brāhmanakalasahlāya || brāhmaṇa bhojanaṃ || vaṭulavanabhakṣaṇaṃ || 
iti vedārambhanavidhi samāpta ||

tato śrāvanīkarmmavidhi ||
vaṭunadyāṃ snānaṃ mācaret || vaṭu nitya ajñārikarmmaṃ kuryāt || tato 
ācāryena yajñavidhisaṃbhāraṃ kṛtvā || śrāvaṇī karmma 
vratavidhinimityārthe sūryārghaṃ ācāryana kalasārccana || vaṭu sahita || oṃ 
tatvājāmetyādi || kalasāgre sapta ṛkṣiprapūjayet || atra gaṃdhādi || tato devādi 
tarppayet || ṛṣītarppaṇaṃ || yavākṣata saha || miśraṃ tarppayet vaṭu || atra 
gaṃdhādi tarppayet || pitā avidyamāne kavyavālādi tarppayet || atra gaṃdhādi || 
ācārye kuśaṃ trikarmmaṃ kuryāt || yathā <2> vidhimaṃtrena kalasārccanaṃ || 
artha padāsādhanaṃ || agni daśakriyā || agnināma || samudbhavāgni ||

<p. 38>) tra laṃṣanahāye || svānataṃnake brahmā ādina || stotra yācake || oṃ yaṃ 
brahmā caru || mitaṃ phaṃ ṭāḍacā sagoṇanatvāye || phaninicchāye || oṃ 
trātāramiṃdra || 

<p. 39a> paṃcavāruṇānta ghṛtāhuti || ghṛtāhuti pūrṇā || tilāhuti || kalasa 
pratiṣṭhā || saṃkṣāhuti || vaṭuvratahile || adhovāsa ādina pūrvvavidhina || āhuti 
|| oṃ pavitrastho || āryāhuti || vaṭukalaśaṅuyakāvajavadosate || tato agyārī karmma 
kuryāt pūrvvavat || bhikṣācchuye || dhanāsiye || brāhmaṇa pūjā || śāntika 
pauṣṭika || yavadhānyādi || aṃna saṃkalpa || dakṣinā || pūrṇā || āsaṃsā || 
āśīrvvāda || seṣahoma || nyāsayāya || agni ṛṣī baliviśarjana || 
koṭolasaṣolaṃṣatasyaṃ ṛṣīkuśana abhipekāya || oṃ devasya tvā <3> 
koṭolasa ṛṣīcoye || oṃ samudraṃ gaccha svāhā || ṛṣī nadyāṃ vāharape || 
kalasābhiṣeka || caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || rakṣāpradāna vaṭu || komārī visarjana 
|| tato vaṭubhikṣā karaṇaṃ || dhānāhnijāsacchāya || bhojyaṃ kṛtvā || ekabhakta || 
iti śrāvaṇīkarma samāptaḥ ||

<p. 39b> tato samāvarttanakarmma ||
vaṭunityakarmma kuryāt || nyāsayāṅāva || agnivisarjanayāya || agnikuṇḍapūrvva 
brahmā aṣṭakalaśa tīrthodakena pūritā || samāvarttanoddeśa ābhyudaikaṃ 
kṛtvā || thaṃkāḍisyaṃ || ācāryesyaṃ kuśaṃ trīkarmmaṅkuryāt || 
yathāvidhimaṃtreṇa || brahmāpūjā || oṃ tatvājāmetyādi || padmāsnāya nama || 
haṃsāsnāya nama || oṃ brahmaṇe nama dhyāna || 

pīnaṃ pīta caturbbāhuṃ brahmānaṃ caturānanaṃ ||
haṃsayānaṃ ca vibhrānaṃ daṇḍākṣaḥ śrukkamaṇḍaluṃ ||

brahmaṇe nama || prajāpataye nama || caturānanāya nama || sṛṣṭikarttāya nama || oṃ 
brahmayajñānaṃ || oṃ brahmanaspate || oṃ ābrahmaṃ || oṃ dhāmacchadagni || atra 
gaṃdhādi || aṣṭakalasapūjā || dharāya nama || oṃ juṃ jate || dhurāya nama || oṃ 
idaṃ viṣṇu || somāya nama || oṃ irāvatī || adbho nama || oṃ devaśruto ||

<p. 40a> anilāya nama || oṃ dhiṣṇārṇukaṃ || analāya nama || oṃ divo vā viṣṇu || 
pratyuṣāya nama || oṃ vrataviṣṇu || prabhāsāya nama || oṃ viṣṇorarāṭamasi || atra 
gaṃdhādi || oṃ ākṛṣṇetyādi || oṃ trātāramīndra || oṃ aśvasthetyādi || oṃ 
ardhamāsātyādi || bahiraṃgaṇapūjā || oṃ manojuti pratiṣṭhā || jāpa || stotra || oṃ 
ūrddhaṃ brahmāṇḍe khaṇḍetyādi || artha padāsādanānte || agnidaśakriyā || 
agnināma || oṃ sūryāgnaye svāhā || ghṛtāhuti || ghṛtāhuti pūrṇā || tilāhuti || 
kalasapratiṣṭhā || saṃkṣāhuti || vaṭu ānayet || tato guroragre maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā || 
hastāṃjaliṃ kṛtvā vaṭu paṭhet || 
oṃ brahmacaryavrataṃ śreṣṭhaṃ vratānāṃ cottamaṃ vrataṃ | 
etadvādaśavarṣāṇi khaṇḍitaṃ tvadvrataṃ mayā ||
jñānavṛddhi bhaveddeho āśīrvvādaṃ datātu me ||
vrataprabhāva sarvvajña vratamokṣaṃ kuruṣva me || 
svastiti prativracanaṃ || vaṭu paṭhati ||

<p. 40b> samnāsyāmi || ācāryena || snāhi || tato vaṭu ajñāpi karmma kuyāt || 
mantra pūrvvavat || tato ācāryayo agneruttarataḥ kuśāsanaṃ svastikāsane 
upaviśya || vaṭu vastrenācchādya || nṛvaṃcchanaṃ kṛtvā || ācāryena 
tāmrapātre || aṣṭakalaśodakaṃ stokaṃ stokaṃ gṛhītvā maṃtra || oṃ ye 
aptvaṃtaragnayaḥ praviṣṭhā | prathame || oṃ gohya || dvitīye || oṃ upagohyā || tṛtīye || 
oṃ mayūṣā caturthe || oṃ manohā || paṃcame || skhalu || ṣaṣṭhe || oṃ viruja || saptame || 
oṃ tanūduṣu || aṣṭame || oṃ indriyahāsi || samudrakaḥ pūrvvavataḥ kṣipe maṃtra 
|| oṃ tāṃ vijahāmi || iti arghamarghasnānaṃ || punastenodakena patrikābhyaṃtare 
vaṭumabhyukṣaṇa maṃtra || oṃ yorocanāstava gṛhnāmi || tāmrapātre nidhāya || 
abhiṣīṃcana maṃtra || oṃ tenāhaṃ mābhiṣiṃcāmi jasasve tejase 
brahmavarccasāya balāya indrīyāyāṃ vīryāyānnādyāyarāyasyo 

<p. 41a> ṣāya tukṣāya apacityai yenāstrīmakuraṃtapayenāyāmasatāṃ 
surāṃyenekṣāṃ nabhiṣiṃcati yene māṃ pṛthivī 
mahiyadvāntadaśvināyasataṃ nāmābhiṣiṃcati || punarabhyukṣaṇa maṃtra || oṃ 
yorocanāstava gṛhnāmi || oṃ teneva mabiṣiṃcāmi śriyai yaśase brahmaṇe 
brahmavarccasāya || punarabhyukṣaṇa maṃtra || oṃ yorocanāstava gṛhnāmi || 
oṃ yena śriya me kṛṇvatāṃ yenāvamṛsatāguṃ surāṃ |
yenākṣāvabhyaṣiṃcatāṃ yadvā tamaśvimāyaśaḥ ||
punarabhyukṣaṇa maṃtra || yo rocanāstava gṛhnāmi || oṃ āpo hiṣṭā || 
punarubhyukṣaṇa maṃtra oṃ yo rocanāstava gṛhnāmi || oṃ yo vaḥ śivataḥ || 
punarabhyukṣaṇa maṃtraṃ || oṃ yo rocanāstava gṛhnāmi || oṃ tasmā araṃga || puna 
abhyukṣaṇa maṃtra || oṃ yo rocanāstava gṛhnāmi || tūṣṇīmabhyukṣaṇaṃ || 
punaḥ || oṃ yo rocanāstava gṛhnāmi || tūṣṇīmabhyūkṣaṇaṃ vaṭu || paścādvaṭu 
|| vastrakotoya 

<p. 41b> tūṣṇīna || maṃjakoṭoya śiraṇathaṃ kāsyaṃ maṃtra || oṃ uduttameti || 
daṇḍareṣṭayati muṃja || daṇḍapūrvve nidhāya || kṛṣṇāṃjina pīṭhīkā || 
tūṣṇīnnidhāya || anyatra vastraparidhānaṃ ca || vaṭurācamya || 
ādityopavaddhāṃjali udakaṃ kṣipet maṃtraḥ || oṃ udyaṃ bhrājabhṛṣṇurindro 
marudbhirasthā pratiryāvabhirasthā daśasanirasi 
daśasanirmmākurvvāvidaṃmāgamayaḥ | prathama || punaḥ || udakāṃjaliṃ 
kṣipet || oṃ udyaṃ bhrājabhṛṣṇurindro marudbhirasthāt divāyāvabhirasthāt 
śatasaniramiśatasanirmmā kurvvā vidaṃmāgamaya || dvitīya || puna 
udakāṃjaliṃ ṣipet || oṃ udyaṃ bhrājabhṛṣṇuridro marudbhirasthātsāyaṃ 
yāvabhirasthāt sahasrasanirasi sahasranirmmākurvvāvidammāgamaya || iti tṛtīyaṃ 
datvāditya || tato vaṭuvākcchodanaṃ || vaṭumātaramāhvaya || vaṭu daivajñanā 
spṛṣṭvā || 

<p. 42a> paścāttāmrabhājane uṣṇodakaṃ kṛtvā yajñakuṇḍe || dadhi 
svetatilaṃ ṣipet || tato tenoṣṇodakena vaṭukleśadayet || paścātnāpikena 
keśanakhaṃcchedayet || snānaṃ kuryāt || uḍuṃvareṇa daṃtadhāvana mantra || oṃ 
annādyāya vyūhadhva gūṁ somorājāya māgamatna | 
samāmukhaṃ pramārjyate yaśaśā ca bhagena ca || 

ācamanaṃ || tataḥ sugaṃdhyo varttanaṃ tūṣṇīṃ || tatoṣṭa kalaśodakena 
snānaṃ pūrvvavat maṃtreṇa || snānavidhiḥ || vaṭurācamya || vaṭuṃ yajñopavita 
pradāna maṃtra || oṃ yajñopavītaṃ || vaṭurmadhyāna saṃdhyāṃ kṛtvā || 
vaṭurācāryasya uttarabhāge tiṣṭhati || vaṭuhastena caṃdanaṃ gṛhītvā 
mukhanāsikā cakṣu karṇayo lepana maṃtra || oṃ prāṇaṃ prānau me tarppaya 
taccakṣurmme tarppayet || śrotaṃ me tarppayet || avidyamānye pitari || 
pitṛbhyostilodakaṃ dadyāt || vidyamānyapitari pitara sudhadhvaṃ || hastaṃ 
prakṣālya || vaṭuhasta caṃdana gṛhītvā paṭhati maṃtra ||

<p. 42b> oṃ sucakṣā ahamīkṣābhyāṃ bhūyā sa gūṁ sucace mukhena suśruta 
karṇābhyāṃ bhūyāsaṃ || atha nūtanavastrapariharaṇa maṃtra || 
oṃ paridhāsyaiya sādhāsyai dīrghāyutvāyaradaṣṭirasmi |
śataṃ ca jīvāmi śaradaḥ purīcīrāya poṣamabhisaṃvyayiṣya ||
athottarīya haraṇa maṃtra || oṃ yasasāmādyā vā pṛthivī || śiro veṣṭana matra || oṃ 
yuvāsuvāsā || ceta maṃtra || oṃ jadadyaka || ṭvāka svāna maṃtra || 
oṃ yā āhāra jamadagniḥ śraddhāyai kāmāyaindriyāya || 
tā ahaṃ pratigṛhnāmi yaśasā ca bhagena ca ||  
mālāpuṣpena veṣṭaya maṃtra || oṃ yadyasopsarasomindraścakāra vipulaṃ pṛthu |
tena saṃgraṃthitā sumarasā āvadhnāmi śiro yaśomayi ||
atha karṇābharaṇa maṃtra || oṃ alaṃkaraṇa masi bhūyolaṃkaraṇamasi 
bhūyāsaṃ || akṣayoḥ aṃjana dhāraṇa maṃtra || oṃ 
vṛttasyāsikanīnakaścakṣurddā asicakṣurmme

<p. 43a> dehi || tataḥ ātmānaṃ darppaṇamavalokana maṃtra || oṃ rociṣṇurasi || oṃ 
yūṃ jaṃti vradhnamaruṣaṃ caraṃtaṃ paritaṣṭhuṣa | rocaṃte rodanādivī || 
chatragrahana maṃtra || oṃ bṛhaspatecchadirasi pāṣmano romaṃ tardhehi || tejaso 
jasaśomāmaṃtardhyehi || upānadaugrahanamaṃtra || oṃ pratiṣṭestho 
viśvatomāpātaṃ || pādayo paridhanaṃ kuryāt || karvvata pradāna maṃtra || oṃ 
svasti na indro || vaidadaṇḍadhāraṇa maṃtra || oṃ viśvāmānāṣṭrābhyasparipāhi 
sarvvataḥ || svādhyāyanādi daṃtadānātāsnānakarttā karoti nābrahmacārya || 
saṃbalaviya || oṃ dīrghāyustvā || tato mātā saṃbhāṣitaṃ || deśāntara gamanaṃ 
|| pitāparivarggasakhāyana saṃbodhitā ānayedvaṭu || āyātā gṛhadvāreṣu || 
nṛvaṃcchana lokopacāraṃ kṛtvā || vaṭuryajñasiṃhāsane uttaradisa upaviśya || 
āhuti || oṃ ākṛṣṇa || samāvarttana || oṃ manojuti ||

<p. 43b> pratiṣṭhā || brāhmaṇa pūjā || śāntika pauṣṭika || yavadhānyādi || 
aṃnasaṃkalpa || dakṣiṇā || pūrṇā || āsaṃsā āśīrvvāda yajñavisarjana || 
baliviśarjana || kaleśābhiṣeka || caṃdana || siṃdūra || saguṇa || āśīrvvāda || atra 
sthitalokana vaṭusaguṇaṃ dadyāt || 
iti samāvarttanavidhikarmma samāptaṃ ||

tato vaṭucaturthadivase sūrya na dṛṣṭa || caturthadina saṃpūrṇe sūryadarśana 
vaṭu || koṭorasalaṃṣatayāva sūryasake arghayācake vaṭu || vaṭuvastrenācchādaye 
|| vaṭusūryyamaṃrgha kṛtvā maṃtra || oṃ svayaṃbhūrasi śreṣṭho 
rasmirvvarccodā asi || varcco me dehi sūryasyāvṛtamanvāvartte || sūrya darśanaṃ 
|| vaṭusnānādi saṃdhyāṃ kṛtvā || vināyaka paśu tarppanaṃ kṛtvā || guru 
ācāryena gṛhakomārī pūjāṃ kṛtvā || vaṭucaṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || komārī 
visarjjanaṃ || samaya || ucchiṣṭakaraṃ

<p. 44a> kacchoya || iti samāvarttana caturthividhi samāptaṃ ||

tato vivāhākarmma || 
divasākramena || pūrvvasevā || pithipūjā || brahmāduṃkāya || yodakayāya || 
ekaviṃśati yajñeṣu vivāhe daśaddine || upanayana trirātraṃ vasekhāsadyaṃ tu 
kārayet || vivāhā hṅathvakohnu prohita ādina mālakolusiṃpācake || 
cāpūjāvane || javodakayāya || thaṃkāḍisyaṃ || lāsālāvaduṃtaṃhe || svastika 
vaṃsocakaṃte || mitaṃphaṃ || tāḍacā || pūjā || nṛvaṃcchana || svānataṃnake || 
mitaṃphaṃ tāḍacā || sagona natvāya || sarabhyaṃḍikāvāya || caṃdanādi 
āśīrvvāda || dakṣinā || vācana || vedārccana || thaṃkaḍi ādina caṃdanādi 
āśīrvvāda || pūjācchoya || pratiṣṭhā || sephaṃ ārathī || māsagheḍe || 
lāsālathaṃtaṃyaṃne || duṃśarajānake || hṅathvakohnuyā vidhi thvate ||

<p. 44b> sātiyā vidhi vasape || brahmākalasa || nāgaghaṃ || jakṣanī || jakṣa || 
śrīlakṣmī || vahiraṃganādi || agnikuṇḍayā pūrvvasathāvarape || pināyakāya || 
aninaphaninakāya || javodakayāya || brahmāpūjāyācake || śivācāryena || 
succhāya || ghaṃthaṃne || vidhitheṃ || lāsālāhe || yāvinaṃ vaṃsocakaṃte || 
nṛvāṃccha || arghapātra laṃkhanahāya || brahmāsasvānataṃnake || 
dīpaloharakṣā || prokṣiṇīliminatvāya || succhāya || cekana oṃ kān ḍātkāḍat || 
koḍa || oṃ dīrghāyustvāya || caṃdanādi śagvana āśīrvvāda || 
caṃdramaṇḍalanaṭvāya || navupūjāyāya || caṃdramaṇḍalahlāya || oṃ manojuti || 
pratiṣṭhā || sephaṃ ārathī || māsagheḍe || lāsālayaṃne hleṅasa || svastika 
savaṃsocakaṃ || vastrana vuviye || upatana yācake || luṃsiṃpācake || 
misāyājurasāsidhranicchāya || vaṃkilaṅa vaṃkithanāviya sindhracchānahṅā ||

<p. 45a> lāsālahe maṇḍapaśate || ye vināsvaṃne || nṛvaṃcchanādi || arghapātra 
laṃṣanahāya || brahmāsa svānataṃnake || dipaloharakṣā sagvana naṭvāya || 
vastrakoṭoya || vastraviye || oṃ vasopavitra || phaninicchāya || oṃ trātāramidra || 
sarabhyaṃdikā || ādraṃkṣāraṃ guḍaścaiva rajanīmadanastathā || 
jyotiṣmatānimatsyāni pūgīlājā samakṣataṃ || sarabhyaṃdikānakoṣāyake oṃ 
ākṛṣṇe || caṃdanādi sagvana āśīrvvāda || aninanatvāya || oṃ śivo 
nāmāsihāsānagāle || oṃ tavavāyu bṛhaspate || prasāda piṭiniviye || 
vaṃdāvanacchuye || oṃ manojuti || pratiṣṭhā || sephaṃ || ārathi māsagheḍe || 
lāsālāvathaṃtāyena || phaninavagajinake || ucchoṭacchoya || phanina koṭoya || 

tato jāmātā āmaṃtranaṃ kuryāt || sasureṇa sūryārghaṃ kṛtvā || oṃ ākṛṣṇe

<p. 45b> yā mātā iṣṭadevatebhyo idamāsanaṃ nama || puṣpa || pādārgha || puṣpa || 
hastārgha caṃdana || yajñopavīta || puṣpa || dhūpa || dīpa || atra gaṃdhādi || 
gaṃdha caṃdanena abhyūkṣaṇa || mantra || 
oṃ madhukaiṭabhamedeṇa bharitāśi vasuṃdharā || 
taddoṣaśamanārthāya śivāṃmigaṃdhavārinā || 
hasta pradānaṃ maṃḍalaṃ kuryāt || hastena kṛmilepanaṃ || 
oṃ sodhitā pṛthivīścaiva gaṃdhavāraṇa repitā || 
pūrvvajanmakṛtaṃ pāpaṃ duḥkṛtaṃ suḥtaṃ tathāḥ ||
oṃ iha janmani pāpānāṃ ehi janmāṃtareṣu ca ||
veṣṭitaṃ karmmaśūtreṇa yanma janmāntareṣu ca ||
karapṛṣṭāṃjaliṃ kṛtvā bhrāmayet karacittasā |
akhaṃḍamaṃḍalodvṛtaṃ yā mātāgraprabhinnayā ||
puṣpaṃ ca vividhākāraṃ jāyaṃte vividhai kure |
tatsarvvaṃ kṣaṃ metāndeva rakṣaṃtu śiva sarvvadā ||
poṭavāsanamaṇḍala <3> || kevo

<p. 46a> vāya || piṃthva indrādi <10> dathva jayādi <8> || duṃthvasadyojātādhi || <5> || 
