druvoyaṃ || etat kanyādāna pratiṣṭhārthaṃ yathā parimita | suvarṇa dakṣiṇāṃ 
stubhyaṃ maha saṃpradattaṃ yā mātreṇa svasura abhiseṣa caṃdana || siṃdhūra || 
āśīrvvāda || oṃ kanyā iva vavaharatu me vā tu ajyaṃ jānā abhicākasīmi | yatra 
soma śruyate yatra yajño ghṛtasya dhārā abhitatpavaṃte || svasureṇa 
thavapakhajuṭoṃ pūjāyāya dakṣināprarjate ||

yāmātreṇa niṣkramanikā maṃtra || 
oṃ yadaiṣi manasā dūraṃ diśonupavanā vahiraṇya pārṇo vai karṇaḥ 
satvāmanmasākami 

