<p. 51a> ṛguvedāya || <4> || indrāya nama <10> ||
ekaṃ oṃkāreṇa ekaṃ tuṣṇi juhoyāt || oṃ eṣoha deva pratiso || 
brahmāpraṇitāsna || jeḍabrahmā svaṃne || 
iti calāsanaṃ ||

oṃ hiraṇyagarbha || oṃ idaṃ viṣṇu || oṃ pratyuṣṭa gūṁ ra || oṃ āpohiṣṭā <3> ||
oṃ brahmayajñānaṃ || oṃ idaṃ viṣṇu || oṃ ābrahma || oṃ viṣṇorarāṭamasi || 
thirāsana pūjanaṃ || oṃ brahmajajñānaṃ || oṃ idaṃ viṣṇu || kayānaścitrā || 
yathā jathāvidhimaṃtreṇa brahmākalaśārccanaṃ brahmārccanaṃ || nyāsa || 
dvārārccanaṃ ||

oṃ tatvāyamityādi || brahmaṇe prajāpataye yidamāsanaṃ nama || tato dhyāna ||

oṃ pītāmbaradharaṃ pītaṃ kṛṣṇāṃjina vibhūṣitaṃ |
padmāsana sthitaṃ devaṃ haṃsavāhanaśobhitaṃ ||

kamaṇḍalukṣasūtrañca daṇḍa pustaka dhāriṇaṃ |
vivāha phaladaṃ saumyaṃ sarvvasiddhipradāyakaṃ ||

<p. 51b> brahmānaṃ vadanaṃ kiṃcit dhyāyante jñānamīśvaraṃ ||

dhyānapuṣpaṃ nama || brahmaṇe nama || prajāpataye nama || caturānanāya nama || 
haṃsasnāye nama || oṃ tatvāyā || veda || oṃ brahmayajñānaṃ || oṃ brahmanaspate || oṃ 
