<p. 53a> oṃ mana prajāpataye svāhā || idaṃ mana || oṃ sarmmāsya vadhute || oṃ 
indrasya vajro indrāya surādhipataye vajrahastāye airāvatāsanāya nama || tato 
prajāpati devatāmānasaṃ ciṃtya brahmāpranita vedalokapālārccanaṃ punaḥ 
homeṣu devārccanaṃ || tripaṃcāya nama || catupaṃcāya nama || devāgātu nama || 
disa nama || vidise nama || svarggāya nama || matyāya nama || pātālāya nama || 
gauryāya nama || skaṃdāya nama || sūryāya nama || caṃdrāya nama || tṛṣṭubhyo 
nama || ā ṛṣibhyo nama || sarvvebhyo nama || devebhyo nama ||

tato agnināmakaranaṃ || 
yojāgnaye svāhā || uttare namo devebhya dakṣiṇe pitṛbhya svadhā || upaparśanaṃ 
|| ita indrāvirjatyāga || pātasudiśate || 

tata cakṣuhoma || agnaye svāhā || idamagnaye || somāya svāhā ||

<p. 53b> idaṃ somāya || agnisomābhyo svāhā || idamagnisomābhyā || tato 
jihvāhoma oṃ agnihvāsi || hiraṇyāya svāhā || ida hiranyāya || 

kanakāya svāhā || idaṃ kanakāyai || raktāya svāhā || idaṃ raktayai || 
suprabhāyai svāhā || idaṃ suprabhāya || kṛṣṇāyai svāhā || idaṃ kṛṣṇāyai || 
atiraktāye svāhā || idaṃ atiraktā dhūmrāya svāhā || idaṃ dhūmāya || 
bahurūpāyai svāhā || idaṃ bahurūpāyai || oṃ saptate agne || idamagnaye śṛṣṭikṛ ||

tato vedāhuti || 'guvedāya svāhā || idaṃ raguvedāyai || pṛthivyai svāhā || idaṃ 
pṛthivyai || agnaye svāhā || idamagnaye || brahmaṇe svāhā || idaṃ brahmaṇe || 
prajāpataye svāhā || midaṃ prajāpataya || devebhya svāhā || idaṃ devebhya ||

<p. 54a> ṛṣibhya svāhā || idaṃ ṛṣibhya || chaṃdobhya svāhā || idaṃ chadobhya || 
śarddhāyai svāhā || idaṃ śarddhāyai || medhāyai svāhā || idaṃ medhāyai || 
sadasaspatayai svāhā || idaṃ sadasaspa anumataye svāhā || idaṃ anumataye || 
jajurvvedāya svāhā || idaṃ jajurvvedāya || antarikṣāya svāhā || idaṃ antarikṣā || 
vāyuve svāhā || idaṃ vāyuve || brahmaṇetyādi svāhā || idaṃ brahmaṇe || 
sāṃvedāya svāhā || idaṃ sāṃvedāya || dive svāhā || idaṃ dive || sūryāya 
svāhā || idaṃ sūryāya || brahmaṇe svāhā || idaṃ brahmaṇetyādi || atharvvedāya 
svāhā || idaṃ atharvvedāya || digbhya svāhā || idaṃ digbhya || caṃdramase 
svāhā || idaṃ caṃdramase || brahmaṇe svāhā || idaṃ brahmaṇetyadi || bhū 
svāhā || idaṃ bhū || bhūva svāhā || idaṃ bhuva ||

<p. 54b> sva svāhā || idaṃ sva || tyāgasahita || oṃ tvano agne || idamagni 
varunābhyāṃ || satvaiṃno agne || idamagni varuṇābhyāṃ || oṃ ayāścāgne || 
idaṃ mayāścāgne || oṃ ye te sataṃ || idaṃ varuṇāya savitre viṣṇuve | viśvebhyo 
devebhya marudbhyaḥ svarkkebhya || oṃ uduttammaṃ idaṃ varuṇāyāditaye ||

oṃ ṛtāṣāḍha ṛtadhāmāgnirgaṃdharvvaḥsana idaṃ brahmakṣetraṃ pātu tasmai 
svāhāḥ vāṭ || idamṛtāṣāḍha ṛtadhāmāgnaye gaṃdharvvoya 
|| oṃ ṛtāṣāḍha ṛtadhāmāgnirgandharvvastasyai ṣaḍhayopsarasomudonāmatābhyaḥ
svāhā || idamoṣadhibhyopsarobhyomudbhyaḥ || oṃ sa gūṁ hito viśvasomā 
sūryogaṃdharvvaḥsana idaṃ brahmakṣatraṃ pātu tasmai svāhā vāṭ || idaṃ sa 
guṁ hitāya viśvasāmne sūryāya gaṃdharvvāya || oṃ sa gūṁ hito viśvasāmā

<p. 55a> sūryo gaṃdharvvastasya marīcayopsarasa āyuvānāmatābhyaḥ svāhā || 
idaṃ marīcibhyopsarobhya āyubhyaḥ || oṃ suṣuṃmnaḥ sūryaraśmiścaṃdramā 
gaṃdharvvaḥsana idaṃ brahmakṣatraṃ pātu tasmai svāhā vāṭ || idaṃ 
suṣumnāya sūryaraśmaye caṃdramase gaṃdharvvāya || oṃ suṣumnaḥ 
sūryaraśmiścandramā gaṃdharvvastasya 
nakṣatrāṃśyapsarasābhekurayonāmatābhyaḥ svāhā || idaṃ 
nakṣatrebhyopsarobhyobhekuribhya || oṃ iṣiro viśvavyavāvāto gaṃdharvvaḥ sana 
idaṃ brahmakṣetraṃ pātu tasmai svāhā || vāṭ || idamiṣirāya 
viśvavyavasanātāya gaṃdharvvāyastasyāyopsarasa ūrjjo nāmatābhyaḥ svāhā 
|| idamadbhyāpsarobhya ūrūbhyaḥ || oṃ tujyuḥ suparṇo yajñā gaṃdharvvaḥsana 
idaṃ brahmakṣatraṃ pātu tasmai svāhā vāta || idaṃ tujyuve suparṇāya yajñāya 
gaṃdharvvāya || 

oṃ tujyuḥ suparṇo yajño gaṃdharvvastasya dakṣiṇā'psarastāvānāmatābhyaḥ 
svāhā || idaṃ dakṣinābhyo 

<p. 55b> psarobhyastāvābhyaḥ || oṃ prajāpatirviśvakarmmāmanogaṃdharvvaḥ sana 
idaṃ brahmakṣatraṃ pātu tasmai svāhā vāṭ || idaṃ prajāpataye viśvakarmmaṇe 
manase gaṃdharvvāya || oṃ 
prajāpatirviśvakarmmāmanogaṃdharvvastasya ṛksāmāṃnyapsarase 
eṣṭayonāmatābhyaḥ svāhā || idaṃ ṛkśāmābhyopsarobhya eṣṭibhyaḥ || 

cittaṃ ca svāhā || idaṃ cittāya || citiśca svāhā || idaṃ cittayai || oṃ ākūṭaṃ ca 
svāhā || idamākūṭāya || oṃ ākṛtiśca svāhā || idamākṛtyai || oṃ vijñātaṃ ca 
svāhā || idaṃ vijñātāya || oṃ vijñātiśca svāhā || idaṃ vijñātai || oṃ manaśca 
svāhā || idaṃ manase || oṃ sakkarīśca svāhā || idaṃ śakorībhyaḥ || oṃ darśaśca 
svāhā || idaṃ darśāya || oṃ paurṇamāsaḥ || idaṃ paurṇamāsāya || oṃ bṛhacca 
svāhā || idaṃ bṛhate || oṃ rathataraṃ ca svāhā || idaṃ rathaṃtarāya ||

<p. 56a> oṃ prajāpatirjayānindrāya vṛṣṇaprāyacchadu (*)(?) vṛtano jayeṣu tasmai 
viśaḥ samanamaṃta sarvāḥsa ugraḥ sa ihavyovabhuvaḥ svāhā || idaṃ 
prajāpataye jayā niṃdrāya ||

oṃ agnirbhūtānāmadhipatiḥ samāvat svasminbrahmanyasmin kṣetraḥ 
syāmāśiṣyasyāṃ purodhāyāmasminkarmaṇyasyān deva hūtyāguṃ svāhā || 
idamagnibhūtānāmadhipataye || 

oṃ indro jeṣṭānāmadhipatiḥ || idamiṃdrāya jeṣṭānāmadhipataye || 
oṃ yamaḥ pṛthivyānāmadhipatiḥ || idaṃ yamagra pṛthivyānāmadhipataye || atro 
oṃ vāyuraṃtarikṣānāmadhipatiḥ || idaṃ vāyave antarikṣā nāmadhipataye ||
oṃ sūryo divādhipatiḥsa || 
idaṃ sūryāya divādhipataye || oṃ caṃdramānakṣatrāṇāmadhipati || idaṃ 
caṃdramase nakṣatrāṇāmadhipaye || 
oṃ bṛhaspatirbbrahmāṇādhipati (*)(?) || idaṃ bṛhaspataye brahmaṇodhipataye ||

<p. 56b> oṃ mitraḥ satyānāmadhipatiḥ || idaṃ mitrāya satyānāmadhipataye || 
oṃ varuṇo apānāmadhipatiḥ || idaṃ varuṇāyāmapānāmadhipataye || 
oṃ samudraḥ gotrānāṃmadhipatiḥ || idaṃ samudrāyaśrotānāmadhipataye ||
oṃ annaguṃsāmrājyānāmadhipati || idamannāya sāmrājyānāmadhipataye ||
oṃ soma oṣadhīnāmadhipati || idaṃ somāya oṣadhīnāmadhipataye ||
oṃ savitāḥ prasavānāmadhipati || idaṃ savitre prasavānāmadhipataye ||
oṃ rudraḥ paśunāmadhipati || idaṃ rudrāya paśunāmadhipataye || 
nyāśa atrodakāṃ sparśanaṃ || 
oṃ tvaṣṭārūpānāmadhipati || idaṃ tvaṣṭrārūpānāmadhipati || 
oṃ viṣṇuḥ parvvatānāmadhipati || idaṃ viṣṇuve parvvatānāmadhipataye || 
oṃ maruto gaṇānāmadhipati ||

<p. 57a> idaṃ maruto gaṇānāmadhipataye ||
oṃ pitarapitāmaha prapitāmaha parebhyaśca tretāmahāprāti 
idagāvatvasmidbrahmaṇyasminakṣatre syāmāsikṣasyāṃ purodhāyāmasmin 
karmmaṇyasyāṃ deva hutyā guṁ svāhā || idaṃ pitṛbhyaḥ || pitāmahebhyaḥ 
parevarebhyaḥ stebhyaḥ prapitāmahebhya || tyāgavaṃśa || arghapātrodakena 
upasparśanaṃ ||

oṃ agniraitu prathamo devatānāṃ sosyai prajāmuṃcatumṛtyupāṇāḥ | tadaya gūṁ 
rājā varuṇonumanyatāṃ yathe ya gūṁ strīpautramaghaṃnarodāt svāhā || 
idamagnaye || oṃ imāmagnistrāyatāṃ gārhapatyaḥ prajāmasyainaya tu dīrghāyuḥ 
| aśūnyopasthā jīvitāmastu mātāpautramānaṃdamabhiviyudhyatāmiya gūṁ 
svāhā || idamagnaye || oṃ svastino agne divā pṛthivyā viśvānidhehya yathā yajatra 
| yadasyāṃ mahi divi jātaṃ praṇastaṃ tadasmāsu draviṇaṃ ca dhehi citraṃ gūṁ 
svāhā || idamagnaye ||

<p. 57b> oṃ suśaṃnupathāpradiśanna ehi jyotiṣmadhe hyajaraṃ na āyuḥ 
apaituramṛtyuṃramṛtaṃma āśādvaivasvatono abhayaṃ kṛṇotune svāhā ||  idaṃ 
mṛsvave vaivasvatāya || thvapaḍapesa kanyāgānaṣuyamāla paḍapetīcakaṃtu deva 
|| oṃ paraṃ mṛtyo anuparehi panthāyaste anya itaro devayānāt | cakṣuṣmate 
śṛṇvate te vravīmimānaḥ prajā gūṁ rirīṣomota vīrāṃ svāhā || idaṃ mṛtyave 
vaivatāya || tyāgavāsa || argha pātrodakena upasparśanaṃ || śaṃśrava praṇīte 
nidhāya || 

ghṛtāhuti sārvvaghṛtāhutipūrṇā || 
oṃ saptate agne || tilāhutiviye sarvva || kalasapratiṣṭhā || saṃkṣāhuti || 

lājāhoma || samidha ghṛtalājājyaṃ losate || oṃ arjjamanaṃ devaṃ 
kanyāmagnimayakṣatasano'so aryamā devapretā muṃcatu māpade

<p. 58a> svāhā || idamagnaye || prathamoti || 
oṃ iyaṃ nāryyupatra telājānāvapaṃtikā | 
āyuṣmānastu me patiraṃdhaṇāṃ jñātayo mama svāhā || 
idamagnaye || imāṃ llājānāvapāmyagnau samṛddhikaraṇaṃ tava |
mama stubhya ca śaṃvadanaṃ tadagniranumaṃnyatāmiya gūṁ svāhā || 
idamagnaye || atha kumāryā dakṣiṇa hastaṃ sāṅguṣṭaṃ varo gṛhnati || maṃtra || 

atha thaṃkādinaṃsāle

oṃ gṛhnāmite saubhagatvāya hastaṃ mayā patyājaradaṣṭiryathā saḥ bhago 
arjamā savitā puraṃdhimajyaiṃ tvādurgārhapatyāya devāḥ | 
amoharmāsmasātva gūṁ sātvamasya amohaṃ | 
sāmāhamasmi ṛktaṃ dyaurahaṃ pṛthivībhyaṃ |
tāva hi vivahāvadai sahareto dadhāvahai |
prajāṃ prajanadāvahai putrān vindyāvahaiva hūnate saṃtujaradaṣṭayaḥ 
saṃpriyau rociṣṇusumanasya mānau paśye maśaradaḥ śataṃ jīvema śaradaḥ 
śata guṁ śṛṇuyāmaśaradaḥ śataṃ || atha masmānamārohetyuttare sthitvā || oṃ 
asmānamasmevatva guṁ sthirā bhava |

<p. 58b> abhitiṣṭhapṛtaṃnyato vavādhasvapṛtanāyataḥ || ārohana maṃtra || 

atha gāyatrī || oṃ sarasvati predamavasubhage vājinīvati |
yā tvaṃ viśvasya bhūtasya prajāyāmasyāgrataḥ 
yasyāṃ bhūta gūṁ samabhavat yasyāṃ viśvamidaṃ jagat ||
tāmadyagāthāṃ gāsyāmi yā strīnāmuttamaṃ jaśaḥ ||

atha magniṃ parikrāmataḥ || jāmātreṇa strīsaha || anininaṭvāya || oṃ śivonāmā 
|| oṃ tubhyamagre paryavahat sūryāṃ vahatunā saha || punaḥ patibhyo 
jāyāṃdāgneḥ prajayā saha || hāsānagāyake || oṃ tava vāyu || 
tripradakṣiṇadhuṃṅāva jāmātreṇa sūryakṛṣṭeta lājātayāva || oṃ bhagāya 
svāhā || oṃ prajāpataye svāhā || tyāgasahita || 

agnikuṃḍase nayāvinaṃ saptapadacchāye || oṃ ekamiṣe viṣṇustvā nayatu || dve 
ūrye viṣṇustvā nayatu || oṃ trīṇi rāyasyopāya viṣṇustvāyatu || oṃ catvāri mayā 
bhavāya viṣṇustvā nayatu || oṃ paṃcapaśubhyo

<p. 59a> viṣṇustvā nayatu || oṃ ṣaḍṛtubhyo viṣṇustvā nayatu || oṃ seṣe 
saptapadābhavaḥ sāmāmanuvratā bhava viṣṇustvā nayatu || 
udakṣuṃbhābhiṣecanaṃ || oṃ āpaḥ śivāḥ śivatamāḥ śāntāḥ 
śāntatamāstāste kṛṇvatu bheṣajaṃ || oṃ āpohiṣṭā <3> || sūryadarśaṇa || oṃ 
taccakṣu || siṃdhūrinaṅaviye || oṃ vasopavitramantra || śiṃdhracchāya || oṃ 
sumaṃgalīriyaṃ vadhurimā guṁ sameta paśyata saubhājñamasyai datvā 
yāthāstvaṃ viparetana || siṃdhramuṅahlāya || oṃ śrīścate || hṛdayālambhana || oṃ 
mama vrateta hṛdayaṃ dadhāmi | mama cittamanucitante astu || mama vācameka 
manājukha svaprajāpatistvāniyunakumahyaṃ || gorathāvarohana || oṃ iha gāvo 
niṣīdanti ihā (*)(?) iha puruṣa iho sahasradakṣiṇo yajña iha puṣā niṣīdatu || 
dhruvadarśana || oṃ dhruvamaśri dhruvaṃ tvāpasyāmi dhruva

<p. 59b> idhipoṣyāmayi mahyaṃ tvādādvṛhaspatiḥ mayā patyā prajāvatī 
saṃjīva saradaḥ sataṃ || khvanomanapāne || ghṛtāhuti || oṃ prajāpataye svāhā || oṃ 
sṛṣṭikṛtaya svāhā || tilāhuti || oṃ tṛmvakaṃ || vivāhā || oṃ manojuti || pratiṣṭhā || 
vādāvanacchoye ||

brāhmaṇapūjā || santika puṣṭika || javadhānyalājā || aṃna saṃkalpa || 
digārccana || balipūjā || ghṛtadīparttikā || svasthāgnehā upa || paṃcavāruṇa || 
pāhino agne svāhā || yajñaṃ pāhi vibhāvase svāhā || sarvva pāhi satakṛye 
svāhā || nunāti atiraktaṃ juhomi svāhā || anājñātaṃ yadājñātaṃ 
tatsarvvakṛte mastu(?) svāhā || sarvva tadagne kalpati vihate tu hutāsana svāhā || 
vaiśvānarāyavi || deva kṛtasyaina sovayajanamasi svāhā || manuṣyakṛta 
sainasovayajanamasi svāhā || pitṛkṛtasainasovayajanamasi svāhā || ātmakṛtasaina

<p. 60a> śvavayajanamasi svāhā || senase enasovayajanamasi svāhā || yaccāha meno 
vidvāścakāra || yaccā vidvā tasya sainaśovayajanamasi svāhā || oṃ svasti na indra 
|| oṃ paya pṛthivyāṃ || oṃ viṣṇorarāṭama || oṃ agnirdevatā || oṃ dyau śāntiraṃta || 
brāhmaṇe dakṣinā || baliharaṇaṃ || saṃsravanaprāsne || oṃ sumitriyāna ||

pavitramocanaṃ || pūrṇāhuti || oṃ devāgātuvi || oṃ āpyāya || oṃ hemasetvā || 
āsaṃsā kṛtvā || āśīrvvāda || oṃ utiṣṭabrahma || brahmāviśarjana || oṃ 
viṣṇorarāṭa || praṇitavisarjana || oṃ kastvāvimu || oṃ apo adyānu || oṃ 
saṃvarahiraṃtā || oṃ tanupāgnesi || oṃ yajñayajñaṃ gaccha || gaccha <2> sura || 
seṣahoma || tāṃbūlaṃ dadyāt || nyāsa || agnivisarjana || vācana laṃṣana abhiṣeṣa 
|| caṃdanādī āśīrvvāda || thaṃtāyeṅāva saha bhojye || iti vivāha

<p. 60b> karmma samāpta ||

bhramanajātrā brahmāsa svānataṃne || vadhuvā ātrasate || maṃgare jātrā || 
gṛhadvāreṣu || nṛvaṃcchanādi lokopacāraṃ kṛtvā || lāsālāva maṇḍapahe || 
brahmāsa svānataṃne || caṃdanādi sagvana āśīrvvāda || oṃ kāṃḍāt || oṃ 
manojuti || pratiṣṭhā || hāsānagāyake || vādāvanecchoya || sephaṃ || ārathi || 
māsagheḍe || lāsālāvathaṃtoyaṃne || sahabhojananake || gvayaviyake 
iti bhramanajātrāvidhi samāptaḥ ||

tato caturthīkarmma kuryāt ||
nityakarmma mālābhālo || tāmbureṇa saha bhojana || jāmātreṇa kuśaṇḍikarmma 
kuryāt || yathā yathāvidhimaṃtreṇa kalaśārccanaṃ || arthapadāsādhanaṃte || 
caru sādhanaṃ || agnidaśakriyā || agnināma || oṃ yojāgnaye svāhā || 
pūrvvāghāṭa || uttarāghāṭa || caṃ ca vāruṇānte saṃśrava prāsanānte 
nidhāya || oṃ prajāpata svāhā || oṃ agni

<p. 61a> sṛṣṭikṛtaye svāhā || kuṇḍāgre udakapātramekasyadyā || kapālāya 
idamāsanaṃ nama || puṣpaṃ nama || oṃ kapālāya svāhā || idaṃ kapālāya || 
ghṛtanāhutimaṃtra || oṃ agneḥ prāyaścitte tvaṃ devānāṃ prāyaścittirasi 
brāhmaṇastvā nāthakāma upadhāvāmiyāsyaipati śrītanutāmasyai nāsaye 
svāhā || idaṃ magnaye || oṃ vāyo prāyaścitte tvaṃ devānāṃ prāyaścittirasi 
brāhmaṇastvānāthakāma upadhāvāmiyāsyai prajāghnītanū vāmasyai nāsaya 
svāhā || idaṃ vāyave || oṃ sūrya prāyaścittetvaṃ devānāṃ prāyaścittirasi 
brāhmaṇastvānāthakāma upadhāvāmiyāsyai pasughnī tanūtāmasyai nāsaya 
svāhā || idaṃ sūryāya || oṃ caṃdraḥ prāyaścittetvaṃ devānāṃ prāyaścittirasi 
brāhmaṇastvānāthakāma upadhāvāmiyāsyai gṛhaghnī tanūtāmasyai nāsaya 
svāhā || idaṃ caṃdrāya || oṃ gaṃdharvvaḥ prāyaścittetvaṃ devānāṃ 
prāyaścittirasi brāhmaṇastvānātha 

<p. 61b> kāma upadhāvāmiyāsyai jasoghnī tanutāmasyai nāsaya svāhā || idaṃ 
gaṃdharvvāya ghṛtāhuti sarvva dadyāt || ghṛtāhuti pūrṇā tilāhuti dadyāt || 
kalasapratiṣṭhā || saṃkṣāhuti || vadhu || siṃdhurī pāṭānasyacake || 
nipatinaṅayake || purakhenalāsālahe || yajñasiṃhāsana uttarabhāge svastikāsane 
upaviśya pūrvvamukhaṃ || nṛvaṃcchana || arghapātra laṃṣvanahāye || 
svānataṃnake || metaṃphaṃ || tāḍavo || sagvana naṭvāya cusivarānajhuliṅole || 
tṛtatvena sodhayet || kuṇḍāgne sthāpana udakena vadhu muddhi abhiṣiṃcati maṃtra 
|| oṃ yāte patighni prajāghnī paśughnī gṛhaghnī yaśoghnī nihitā tanujāraghnī 
tata enāṃ karomi sājīryatvaṃ mayā sahasāviti || iti amukadevītisubhikṣaṇā || 
didhitheṃ saṃpyāya || caṃdanādi āśīrvvāda || caruprāsana || prāsanānte 
vadhusva āsana upaviśya || āhuti || oṃ śrīścate ||

<p. 62a> oṃ manojuti pratiṣṭhā || vadhuhṛdayāmālaṃbhana maṃtra || 
oṃ yatte susīme hṛdayaṃ diva caṃdramasiśritaṃ | vedāhaṃ tadvidyāt paśyema 
śaradaḥ sataṃ jīvema śaradaḥ śataguṃ śṛṇuyāma śaradaḥ śataṃ || 
brāhmaṇapūjā || śāntikaḥ pauṣṭika || vidhitheṃ yajñadhunake || yināya hlāye || 
brahmālaṃkhaluye || somādhe viya || iti caturthakarmmavidhi samāpta ||

samvat <679>(?) jyeṣṭhavaddhi || ekādaśyāṃ tithau || aśvinī nakṣatre || ati gaṃḍayoge 
|| guruvāśare saṃpūrṇa daśakarmma brahmasāstra iti || dvijavalottama vipra 
śrījayanta devasya liṣitaṃ || sāṃphuliṃjuroṃ śubhamastu sarvvadākāraṃ 
śubhaḥ ||

oṃ apā guṁ rasamuddhayasa guṁ sūryyasanta guṁ samāhitaṃ | 
apā guṁ rasasya yorasastaṃ gṛhmāmyuttama || 

oṃ vvasuścamevvasatiśca me karmma ca me śaktirtheścame ekaścame ityācame 
gatiścame yajñena kalpatāṃ ||

<p. 62b> viśvataścakṣuruta viśvato mukho vito bāhuruta viśvatasyāt | 
saṃvābhyāṃ dhamati saṃpatatairdyāvābhūmājanayandeva eka

oṃ athāta āditya duhitā tapasā bhāvitā jaṭādhārā valkalājina 
saṃcchannāstapastepe | kumārī bahūni varṣasahasrāṇi tapasā tejasā tapatīti 
vikhyātā tāṃ chabharaṇastadhaikyabhonṛpa sūnurmama vākyaṃ || brāhmaṇī 
vatsaro bhavā eṣā tadārikadārikā | avidhavā aṣūputrā jīvavatsānuttara vādī 
priya vādī preṣaṇakārī satyavādī | brāhmaṇastavaṃ devataṃ mātaraṃ tyajati 
pitaraṃ tyajati bharttāraṃ cārggitaṃ ca pūjitaṃ ca supūjitaṃ ca || 
yathendrasyendrāṇī yathā daśarathasya kauśalyā 
yathā rāmasya śītā yathā rāvaṇasya mandodarī 
yathā vāreśca tārā yathā vāyorañjanā 
yathā nalasya damayantī yathāsyaidāsasya medayantī |
yathā puroravasya urvvaśī yathā puruṣasya ca narmmadā 
yathā sāntanośca gaṃgā yathā dhṛtarāstasya gaṃdhārī
yathā paṇḍośca kuntī yathā pāṇḍavānāṃ ca dropadī 
yathā arjjunasya śubhadrā yathā bhīmasenasya herambā 
yathā durjjodhanasya bhānumatī yathādityasya chāyā
yathā caṃdrasya rohiṇī yathā gaṇapateśca buddhimatī |
yathā tejānusūyā yathā agastyasya lopāmudrā 
yathā yogeśvarasya mayitreyī yathā brahmaṇaḥ sāvitrī 
yathā viṣṇo rukminī yathā umā paśupataḥ |
evaṃ tubhyamimāṃ gṛhe vasatu vaśo(?)ddārā suprītā suprītā bhavantu || 
athāto maṃgalāni māhendra vāruṇe sobhavāni suśobhavāṇī ||

<p. 63a> oṃ ṛcamvācamprapadye manoyajuḥ prapadye sāma prāṇan prapadye cakṣuḥ 
śrotram prapadye | vvāgojaḥ sahaujo mayi prāṇāpānau || <1> ||

yanmechidrañcakṣuṣo hṛdayasya manasovvātitṛṇumbṛhaspatirmme taddadhātu |
sano bhavatu bhuvanasya yaspatiḥ || <2> || 
bhūrbhuvaḥ || bhūbhuvaḥ svaḥ || tatsaviturvvareṇyambharggo devasya dhīmahi |
dhiyo jonaḥ pracocayat || <3> || 
kayānaścitra ābhūvadūtī sadā vṛdhaḥ sakhā | kayāsa ciṣṭayā vṛtā || <4> || 
kastvā satyomadānāmma guṁ hiṣṭomatsadandhasaḥ | dṛḍhā cidārujevvasu || <5> || 
abhīṣuṇaḥ sakhīnāma vitājari tṛṇāṃ | satambhavāsyūtibhiḥ || <6> || 
kayātvaṃ na ūtyābhipramandasevvṛṣaṃ | kayāsto tṛbhya ābhara || <7> ||
indrovviśvasyaḥ rājatiḥ | sanno astu dvipade sañcatuṣpade || <8> ||
sanno mitraḥ saṃvaruṇaḥ saṃno bhavatvaryamā | 
sanna indro vṛhaspatiḥ saṃnovviṣṇu ruru kramaḥ || <9> || 
sanno vātaḥ pavatā guṁ śannastapatu sūryaḥ |
śaṃna kanikradaddevaḥ parjjanyo abhivarṣitu || <10> ||
ahāni sambhavaṃ tu

<p. 63b> naḥ sa gūṁ rātrīḥ pratidhīyatāṃ |
saṃna indrāgnībhatāmavobhiḥ sanna indrāvvaruṇā rātahavyā |
śanna indrā pūṣanāvvājasāto samindrāya somāsuvitāya saṃyoḥ || <11> ||
saṃno devīrabhiṣūya āpo bhavaṃtu pītaye | saṃjorabhisravaṃtu naḥ || <12> ||
syonā pṛthivino bhavānṛkṣarā nivesanī | jachānaḥ sarmmasaprathāḥ || <13> ||
āpo hiṣṭāmayo bhūvastāna ūrjjadadhātana | maheraṇāya cakṣase || <14> ||
yovaḥ sivatamo rasastama bhājayate hana || usatī rivamātara || <15> ||
tasmā araṃgamāma vojasyakṣayāyajinvatha | āpojanayathācanaḥ || <16> ||
dyauḥ śāntirantarikṣa guṁ sāntiḥ pṛthivī sāntirāpaḥ śāntiroṣadhayaḥ 
sāntiḥvvanaspatayaḥ sāntivviśvedevāḥ śāntirbrahmasāntiḥ sarvva guṁ sāntiḥ 
śāntireva sāntiḥ sāmā śāntiredhi || <17> ||
dṛtedṛ guṁ hamāmitrasya mā cakṣuṣā sarvvāṇi bhūtāni samīkṣaṃtā |
mitrasyāhañcakṣuṣā sarvvāṇi bhūtāni samīkṣe |
mitrasya cakṣuṣā samīkṣā mahe || <18>||
dṛte dṛ guṁ hamājyokte

<p. 64a> sadṛsi jīvyā sajyokte sandṛsi jīvyāsam || <19> || 
namaste harase śociṣe namaste astvarcciṣe anyāste asmatta paṃtuhetayaḥ pāvako 
asmabhya guṁ sivo bhava || <20> || 
namaste asturvvidyute namaste stanayitnave | 
namaste bhagavaṃnastujataḥ svaḥ samīhase || <21> || 
yato yataḥ samīhase tanono abhayaṃ kuru |
sanaḥ kuru prajābhyo bhayaṃ naḥ pasubhyaḥ || <22> ||
sumitriyāna āpa oṣadhayaḥ saṃtu durmmitriyāstasmai 
saṃtu josmāṃ dveṣṭhijañcaṃ yaṃvviṣmaḥ || <23> ||
taccakṣurddevahitam purastācchukramuccarataḥ 
pasyema saradaḥ satajive masaradaḥ sata (*) śṛṇuyā 
masaradaḥ satampravravāma saradaḥ sata guṁ śṛṇuyāma saradaḥ satampravravāma 
saradaḥ samadīnāḥ syāma saradaḥ satambhūyaśca saradaḥ satāt || <24> ||

oṃ āpyāya svasametute viśvataḥ somavṛṣnyaṃḥ | bhavāvvājasya saṅgathe || <1> ||
santepayā guṁ sisamujaṃtuvvājāḥ saṃvṛṣnyānyabhimātiṣāha |
āpyāyamāno amṛtāya somadiviśravā guṁ syuttamānidhiṣva || <2> ||
āpyāya svamadintama somaviśvebhira guṁ śubhi |
bhavānaḥ saprathastamaḥ saṣāvṛdhe || <3> ||

<p. 64b> āte vatso manoyamat paramāccitsadhasthāt | agnetvāṅkāmayāgirā || <4> || 
tubhyaṃtā aṅgirastamavviśvāḥ sukṣitayaḥ pṛthak | agne kāmāyajemire || <5> ||
agniḥ priyeṣu dhāmasukāmobhūtasya bhavyasya | sammrāḍekovvirājati || <6> ||
payaḥ pṛthivyāmpa || <7> || devasya tvā || <8> || aśvino bhaiṣajena tejase brahmavarccasā 
yābhirñcāmiḥ sarasvatyai bhaiṣarjyena vīryāyā nādyāyā 
bhiṣiñcāmindrasyaindriyena balāya śrījasasebhiṣaṃcāmi || <9> ||
drupadādi vamumucānaśvi (*)(?) snāto malādiva |
pūtaṃ pavitrenevāyemāpasūṃdhatu menasa || <10> ||
udvayaṃ tamasvaparisvapasyaṃta uttaraṃ |
devaṃ devatrā sūryamagaṃmajotiruttamaṃ || <11> || śrīścate lakṣmī || <12> || 
namo brahmaṇe namaḥ stvagnaye namaḥ pṛthivyai namaḥ oṣadhibhyoḥ 
namo vāceḥ namo vācaspataye namo viṣṇuve mahate karomi || <13> ||
agnirindrasya smamasyadevānāmahutivyaya |
kariṣyaṃtaṃ ca sāmahi kariṣyāmi vrataṃnvata || <14> ||
ye devāso divyaikādasastha pṛthivyāmadhyekādasastha |
apsukṣito mahinaikā

<p. 65a> dasasthate devāso yajñamimaṃjuṣadhvaṃ || <15> ||
punastvādityā rudrāvasavasamidhatāṃ puna brahmāṇo ca sunītha 
yajñai ghṛtena tvaṃ taṃ varddhaya svasatyāsaṃtu yajamānasya kāmā || <16> || 
ābrahmaṃ brāhmaṇo || <17> || prathamā dvitīyai dvitīyā tṛtīyaistṛtīyāḥ satyena 
satyaṃ yajñena yajño yajurbhiyajū guṁ ṣi sāmabhiḥ sāmāṃ nṛgbhir(-)ṛcaḥ 
puronuvākyābhiḥrpuronuvākyāyārjyobhiryājyā vaṣaṭkārairvaṣaṭkārā āhuti 
bhirāhuti yo mekāmāṃ samarddayaṃtu bhūḥ svāhā || <18> || 

oṃ himasyatvā jarāyunāsā leparivyayāmasi |
utahradohinī bhūvognirdadhātu bheṣajaṃ 
śītaḥ hrado hi bhuvognirddadhātu bheṣajaṃ |
antikāmagnirajanayaṃ durvvādaḥsi śurāgamat |
ajātapakṣaputrā ca hṛdayaṃ mama dūyate |
vipulaṃ ca naṃvahvā (*)(?) carajātavedakāmāya |
māśca rakṣaputrāśca rakṣa saranaṃ masyai tava 
piglakṣa lohita grīva kṛṣṇavarṇa namostute ||
asmāni vajhahirasvonā sāgarasvormmayo yathā |
indraḥ kṣatraṃ dadātu varuṇa tvaṃ mabhikṣiṃ catu |
satravo nidhanaṃ yānti jayatvaṃ brahmatejasā |

<p. 65b> kapila jatīṃ sarvvabhakṣiṃ cāgnipratyaṣya devatāṃ |
varunaṃ tava sā yajñā mama putrāśca rakṣasi |
jāvadādityastapati yāvat bhrājadi candramā |
yāvadvātaḥ plavahaṃti jāvat jīva tvayā saha |
jenakena prakārena mohanākona jīvati |
paleṣāmupakārāṇāṃ jajjīvati sajīvati |
ekasphe jhahastena deśena tvaṃ vipurena 
pṛthivī tvaṃ bhujaḥ mekacchatrena daṇḍana ||

oṃ namo brahmaṇe nama || 
ūrddhabrahmāṇḍakhaṇḍaṃ nijapavanayanaṃ brahmayogī svarūpaṃ 
devānāṃ | jeṣṭabhūtaṃ sarasija nayanaṃ rājahaṃsāsanasthaṃ |
campotphūlāṅgavarṇa bhūjavaracaturaṃ cākṣamālājapataṃ 
śāsvadvedaṃ vahaṃ tadvijagaṇasakalaṃ cintayentvandvijendraṃ || <3> || 
śrīmaddastolipāṇiṃḥ suravaraṇamimataṃ devadevaṃ manojñaṃ 
nākesaṃśotamasthaṃ jagati subhakaraṃ satsacījīvabhūtaṃ |
yakṣānāgāṅganābhirmmuṇiganasakalairsiddhividyādhanervvā
vande digpālasakraṃ daśasatanayanaṃ vigrahaṅkocanābhaṃ ||
indrādyā lokapālāṃ svasvadigavasitā svasvamudrā svayuktā

<p. 66a> ādityādi grahai sāṃ vasati bhuvi sadā janma devo svarūpā |
ṛkṣāyogā sutīrthā gaṇaguruvaṭukāsthaṃdile mātṛke vāḥ 
siddhiḥ śrayo dadātu bhavatu vasumatī yajñapūrṇā subhostu |
oṃ namo agnaye <2> || 

tejākṣaṃ khyātiṃ visvaṃ bhava kalu khaharaṃ pāvanaṃ bhūrbhuva svaḥ 
sarvvāyaṃ visvavyāptaṃ munijanaṇamitaṃ bhāsvaraṃ saktihastaṃ | 
jaṃtoścābhyaṃtarātmā kanamapiśikaraṃ sūṣma sūkṣmāti sūkṣmaṃ 
vaṃde varṇādya ketuṃ dvija nikhila guruṃ sociṣe sambhavataṃ ||

saptācāla svasāntanāhutavahaṃdya vyādi pūrṇā tathā
nānākāmaphalodayaṃ hutajutaṃ saṃpūrṇakāmapradaṃ |
varnāvarnaśikhāni saṃprakatitaṃ siddhāṃ namaṃci
divyānāhuti dāturtvastirbhavān sānaṃdarūupa śiva ||

ye ye yajñeṣu saṃsthā digavidigasamāsaṃsthītā devatāyā 
kuṇḍe vā vahni madhye sakala parijanā maṇḍalasthaṃḍile vā |
te sarvve saṃtu devā abhimata baladā maṃtra santoṣa mudrā 
mudrā pūjā vidhānāya janaparivitaṃ ṣīṇadoṣākṣayaṃtu ||

ṛgvedo yasya pādo yajura parapadaṃḥ sāmavedotha hastaṃ

<p. 66b> eṣo atharvvā dvitīyaṃ satapathavadanaṃ vyāhretaṃ brahmaghoṣaṃ ||
gāyatrī yasya gātraṃ nayanamupaniṣadbrahmasūtre vadaṃṣṭā viṣṇuḥ 
pracchanaṃ mūrtti bhavatu vasumatī yajñe rūpī varāha || 

brāhmaviṣṇuḥśca (*)(?) sakro jvaroti jamakaraḥ rakṣapāśī samīra
jakṣosyānaka durggāgrahagaṇasahitaṃ saṃyukta sarvvaṇāgā |
heraṃbā siddhisaṃhā duritabhayaharā caṃdrasūryādhidevyā
yoginyāṃ sarvvadevāḥ suravarasahitāḥ pātuvo sarvvadevā ||

suprītā sarvvadevāhavisakalayutā agnimukṣātibhakṣā hutvā 
pūrṇā sūbhājyaṃ sakalasubhadayaṃ sāntikaṃ pustijasyā |
śantoṣā tasya sarvve abhimatavaradā sarvvasiddhi dadaṃtu tāṃ 
devī naimi bhaktyā sakalasuragaṇā yajñarūpīnnamostu ||

asmatmaṃtrārthā santu kalaśasthaṇḍila digadevatā suprītā varadā bhavantu |

amuka agnibhaṭṭārakasya suprītā varadā bhavantu || 
go brāhmaṇebhyaḥ śubhaṃ bhavantu || 
rājādharmma vijayo bhavantu prajā sukhinaḥ santu |
sarvve satvā sukhī bhavantu parjanya kālavaṣī bhavaṃtu |

<p. 67a> dvipada catuṣpadānāṃ śāntiḥ puṣṭirbhavantu ||

devā varṣantu kāle janayati vasudhā śasyasaṃpūrṇamugrā
kṣīrādyāḥ saṃtu gāvonayavipulamatiḥ pātu rājā dharītrī |
sauryaṃ tāṃ sādhuputrī kulayuvati janājāti doṣo vināśaṃ 
lokānāṃ bhaktibhājā prabhavatu vipulā bhaktireṣā śivo'stu ||

asmarāṣṭādhipati khaḍgasiddhirastu | 
yajamānīnāṃ acalasidūramastu |
sagaṇasparivārāṇāṃ āyu ārojña janadhanalakṣmī saṃtati saṃtānavṛddhirastu 
|| 
santaḥ santu niraṃtaraṃ sukṛtino vidhvasta pāpodayā 
rājānaḥ pratipālayantu vasudhā dharmme sthitā sarvvadā |
kāle saṃtati varṣiṇo jalamucaḥ saṃtu prajā moditā 
modaṃtāghaṇavṛddhi vāṃdhuvasuhṛṅgoṣṭī pramovāḥ sadā ||

svasti prajābhyaḥ paripālayatvaṃ nyāyena mārggena mahīmahīśago 
brāhmaṇebhyaḥ śubhamastu nityaṃ lokān samastān sukhīno bhavaṃtu ||
kāle varṣantu paryanyaṃ pṛthīvī śasyamānīnī ||

<p. 67b> deśoyaṃ kṣobharahitā brāhmaṇāsastu nirbhayā ||

ajñānājñānato vā kṛtamakṛtaṃ kṛtaṃ yatkṛtaṃ cāpi ṛktaṃ 
mudrāpūjā vidhānaṃ kramayajanavidhau stotramajñaṃ namajñaṃ 
yajñe yajñeṣu doṣāha virapinahutiṃ sarvvalokeka nāthaṃ 
sarvvasaṃpūrṇamantrajvalanahutavahaṃ prāṃjaliḥ suprasannaṃ ||

doṣeṇa rājñena ca bhaktibhāvā cāpalya duḥkhaṃ munayaḥ prabhāvā |
nūnādhikaṃ mantrakṛpādhvareśa | kṣamasva deva mama doṣahaṃtā ||
tvaṃ gati sarvvabhūtānāṃ saṃṣṭitaṃ na carācare |
antaścāreṇaṃ bhūtānāṃ dṛṣṭvā tvaṃ parameśvara |
karmmanā manasā vācā tato nyāyādikaṃrmata |
akṛtaṃ vākya hīnaṃ tu tatra pūre hutāsana ||
mantrahīnaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ bhaktihīnaṃ tathaiva ca |
japahomārccaṇaṃ hīnaṃ kṣame tāṃ parameśvara ||
brahmaprītirastu ||

<p. 68a> aśīti vyañjanaṃ bhinnaṃ varttakāmiṣa pūrvvakaṃ | 
māsapūrṇeṣu vā māyā bhuṃjā payatu tadvidhiṃ || 
iti śaunaka vacanaṃ || māsāpūrṇakarmmasalānetevayā ||

vṛddhiśrārddhakṛturdakṣaḥ satyānāndimukhe vasuḥ |
naimittike kālakāntau kanyāyāṃ dhruvalocanau || 
pū (*)(?) vāmānavā yajñe viśve devā daśātma (*)(?) ||
aṃbhoya vā payo dūrvā dadhiñca vadarīphalaṃ |
kriyā pūrve tu karttavyaṃ vṛddhi śrārddhaṃ sadoditaṃ ||

oṃ bhāradvāja gotrasya bhāradvājāṅgirasaḥ vānaspatya tripravara mādhyaṃdini 
śākhā vājaśanaiścaraṇasya saṃsārapratipālanaika devottamāṅga sahasra 
mūrtti paramamokṣa pravara mahāvīrāti vīra daityamana pravidārita 
śrīśrīśrīgadādhara parameśvara

<p. 68b> pādapaṃkajārādhanaika caturddaśa bhuvaneśvara paramadevādhipati 
śailādhirājatanayā hṛdayasarovara vilāsanaika rājahaṃsa iṣṭadevatā śrī <3> 
calāneśvara paramabhaṭṭāraka caraṇakamalaparāga dhūladhūsaritottamāṅga 
sakalajanadhanadhānyaratna paśubhṛtyasaṃpradāyaṇī bhagavatī iṣṭadevatī śrī <3> 
matyeśvarī varalabdhaprasādaparivṛṃhitā dvijakulapūṇḍarīka 
mahāvanavikāśanaika mārttaṇḍa paścimāmnāya śrīvaiṣṇava sāṃbhavī 
vidyāvedapadakramachandalakṣaṇasaṃhitā mīmāṃsādi vedaśāstrārthaneka 
catura dakṣiṇāpāṭa tilaka udyotasāna yajurvveda vedāṅga smṛti ṣaṭkarmmādi 
pratipālanaika nipunatilakādbhava śrī <3> tilamādhava sthānabhūmi samīpa 
śrībhaktāpurī nivāsita vānhimasthāne

<p. 69a> vāṃde rājakulagṛha śrī amukadeva somaśarmmasya prapautrāya pautrāya 
putrāya || kanyārthī || vaṃde rājakula brāhmaṇa yā gotāścāraṇajuroṃ || 

kauśikasya gotra kauśikānvaya viśvāmitra devarāja aruṃdhati kauśiketi 
tripravara mādhyandini śākhā vājasanaiścaraṇasya 
śrīśrīśrīgaruḍanārāyaṇārādhana parāyaṇa pradyotita brāhmaṇe tejaḥ 
pravirājamānasya śrī <3> bhaṃgira iṣṭadevatāvaralabdapraśāditasya 
dedīpyamāna brahmavarccasa brahmavidyāvasānasitasya śrī <3> kānti 
mahābhairavārādhana tatparasya nityaṃ yajana yājanā '

<p. 69b> dhyayanādhyāpana dāna pratigraha ṣaṭkarmmābhiratasya ṛgyajuḥ 
sāma'tharvvaṇaḥ padakramaśikṣā kalpa vyākaraṇa nirukti jyotiṣāṃ śati(?) 
chando vicityādayo vedavedāṅga pāraṃgatasya nyāya tarkka khaṇḍana 
vaiṣeṣikādi sarvvaśāstranipunasya śrīnepāladeśīya paramaśrotriyānvaya 
dvijakulakamalavikāśamānaika sahasrakiraṇasya śrī amukadevaśarmmaṇasya || 
triprakvacchaṃ brāhmayā gotrodvāraḥ ||

triyāṃgula bahirlomaccheditā majinata cā | 
keśalekhā vadhirddaṇḍaḥ saptahastāṃ ca meṣalāṃ || 
yogapāṭa daṇḍakaṭhi muñjayā lakṣaṇajuroṃ ||

<p. 70a> bhāradvājasagotrasya bhāradvājāṅgirasa vārhaspatya tripravarasya 
mādhyaṃdini śākhaika deśa vājasanaye caraṇā dhyāyina 
śrīmannepālamaṇimaṇḍalodbhavasya śrīmacchrīśrīgaruḍanārāyaṇa 
caraṇakamala samārādhanaika tatparasya śrīmat 
śrīśrīpaśupatipadārabindamakaranda madhuvratasya śrī <3> matyeśvarī 
mātṛkāpadapaṅkaja parāgapavitrīkṛtottamāṅgasya śrījaya vājeśvarī devī 
saṃpūjanamodamānasya śrīmatśrīkanakacūḍākṣa sadāśivāṃghritoṣana 
parāyaṇasya śrī <3> kubjikeśvarīṣṭadevatā varalabdha prasādaparivṛṃhitasya 
śrīpūrvvāghāṭamahāpāṃcālika kulottama nijakulakamala prakāśanaika 
bhāskarasya vedavedāṃga śrutismṛtītihāsapurāṇāgamādi 
vividhaśāstravicārasa unnatasya viprajajurvveda vaṃśatilakāyamāna śrī 
amukapratyārādhya somaśarmmaṇaḥ papautrāya pautra putra kanyārthī || 

<p. 70b> oṃ kauśikasya gotra kauśikānvaya viśvāmitra devarāja aruṃdhati 
kauśiketi tripravaramādhyaṃdini śākhā vājaśanaiścaraṇasya 
śrīśrīśrīgaruḍanārāyaṇārādhana parāyaṇa pradyotita brāhmaṇe tejaḥ 
pravirājamānasya śrīśrīśrībhaṃgira iṣṭadevatāvaralabdhapraśāditasya 
dedīpyamāna brahmavarccasa brahmavidyāvasāna sitasya śrī <3> 
kāntimahābhairavārādhana tatparasya nityaṃ yajana yājanādhyayanādhyāpane 
dānapratigraha ṣaṭkarmmābhiratasya ṛgyajuḥ sāmātharvvaḥ 
padakramaśikṣākalpa vyākaraṇanirukti jyotiṣāṃgati cchando vicityādayo 
vedavedāṅgapāraṃgatasya nyāyatarkkakhaṇḍana vaiseṣikādi 
sarvvaśāstranipunasya śrīnepāladeśīya paramaśrotriyānvaya 
dvijakulakamalavikāśamānaika sahasrakiraṇasya || triprakvacchaṃ brāhmaṇayā 
gotroccāraṇajuroṃ ||

<p. 71a> oṃ namo vaiśvānarāya || śrīkātyāyana uvāca || 
pāvakasya mukhaṃ vakṣye yaduktaṃ padmayoninā | 
brāhmaṇānāṃ hitārthāya saṃskārārthe tu cāgnaye || 
pāvako bhāṇḍako nāma lokiko dṛṣṭacātmakaṃ |
kīṣṭorbhavaṃ ca nāmāni agniścaiva prakīrttitaḥ ||
agnistu maruto nāma garbhādhāne vidhīyate |
puṃśravaṇe candramasaṃ śubhakarmmaṇi śobhanaṃ ||
sīmanto maṅgalānāma pragarbhā jātakarmmaṇi |
pārthivo nāmakaraṇe suciṣṭaḥ prāsane sthitaḥ ||
cūḍākarṇe sadbhināma vratoddeśe samudbhavaṃ |
vratamokṣe caturthī ca sūryo nāmāni kīrttayet ||
godāne sūryyanāmāgni vivāhe jojakā smṛtā |
caturthī śiṣīnāma dhṛtiragnistathā pare ||
āvasastho bhavānnāma vaiśvadeva tu pāvakaḥ |
brahmāgārihapatyaṃ tu īśvaro dakṣiṇāgnaye ||
devānāṃ havyavāhānāṃ pitṝṇāṃ kavyavāhanaṃ |
prāyaścittaṃ cirīcaiva pākayajñeṣu sāhasaḥ ||
śrāvaṇe śravaṇāgniśca agnicāndheṣu hotrakaṃ |
vadavānalaṃ ca pātāle yajñakarmma dhanañjayaḥ ||
lakṣahome vahnināmā koṭihome hutāśanaḥ |
pūrṇāhutyāṃ mṛdonāmā śāntike tālakaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
puṣṭike balavandhaśca jasorthe ca śriyaṃ bhavet |
vasyārthe kāmado nāma vamadāhṛtuduttakaṃ ||

<p. 71b> kaulike tu kujāgniñca kukṣau tu jatharaḥ smṛtaḥ |
krodhāgnimabhicāreṣu kravyādo mṛtabhakṣaṇe ||
śmaśāne caiva pretāgniṃ kṣayaṃ samvarttako bhavet |
mantre tu bhairavo nāma netre rudrāgni eva ca ||
śrotre tu śivanāmañca vṛrttinī ca divāgniye |
ādityā kapilā nāma somaṃ caiva tu maṅgalaṃ ||
aṅgāraṃ dhūmaketuśca budhaśca jaṭharāgnaye |
devaguru śikhāgnintu śukrasya hāṭakaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
śani tejognikonāma rāhuścaiva hutāsanaṃ |
ketu rudrāgniko nāma rāhuścaiva hutāsanaṃ ||
ketu rudrāgniko nāma vṛṣotsarggeṣu varddhanaṃ |
vaiśvānaro digvā devaṃ cānalaṃ cābhibālake |
gaṇeśvaraṃ gajāgnintu putrajātāgniśobhane ||
saptajihvāsphuraṃte te hutāśana mukhe sthitaṃ |
jābhihavyaśanosnāti hutaṃ samyag dvijottamaṃ ||
kāli kalāli manojavāsudharmma varṇā sthūlaṃginīścaiva tu vismṛtā |
līlāya nānā iti saptajihvā dve śāntike dve puṣṭike trisobhiyalīnameva ca ||
aviṃdatvā tu yo hyagni homayepi vicakṣaṇaḥ |
nahutaṃ na ca saṃskāraṃ naiva karmmaphalaṃ labhet || 
iti agnirnāmāṣṭamapaṭalaḥ || <8> ||

<p. 72>) śrīsūryāya <2> || oṃ ākṛṣṇe || <1> || paśupati || oṃ yāte rudra || <2> ||
garuḍanārāyaṇa || oṃ viṣṇorarā || <3> || śaṃkaranārā || oṃ idaṃ viṣṇu || <4> ||
jhaṃkeśvarī || oṃ bṛhaspate || <5> || matteśvarī || oṃ ambe ambi || <6> ||
siddhilakṣmī || oṃ śrīścate || <7> || kubjikā || oṃ dyāmmāle || <8> ||
varuṇa || oṃ namostu sarppebhyo || <9> || upādhyāsa kevo pūjāyā devajuroṃ ||

