bahukāraṇe ya (*)(?) labhūyaska ceti jayavvaṃ nāmāti kalpāṇamevaita 
namānusaivvā cova (********)(?) asi bhūmasi asidhā asiti tasmādasva medhayājī 
sarvvādi (********)(?) māsami bhūnaṃta yayati || oṃ kāmaṃ kāmadughe 
dhukṣamitrāya varuṇāya ca i (********)(?) prajābhya oṣadibhya atha 
pūrvvādheṇa dakṣiṇā kāmaṃ kāma (********)(?) varuṇāya ca 
